a Effect: Overdose!", "updated_at": 1644976886, "version_parent": 75990, "version_title": "Limited Edition", "checksum": "5c2dcc59-1d39-c114-df26-bd625d22538f", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 167085, "created_at": 1630938127, "genres": [12], "name": "The Legend of Sword and Fairy 6: Limited Edition", "slug": "the-legend-of-sword-and-fairy-6-limited-edition", "summary": "The Legend of Sword and Fairy 6 is a role-playing game. It is the eighth installment in The Legend of Sword and Fairy video game series and its story is set years after the events of The Legend of Sword and Fairy 5. The game incorporates elements of wuxia, shenmo and fantasy.\n\nThis edition includes the following\n- Collector's Box\n- Game: Sword and Fairy 6\n- Soundtrack CD\n- Numbered certificate", "updated_at": 1645078496, "version_parent": 57034, "version_title": "Limited Edition", "checksum": "6919e8ea-af3c-f7ab-674d-91027b6066ea", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 182619, "created_at": 1638380861, "name": "The Robot You Control is a Tsundere!?", "slug": "the-robot-you-control-is-a-tsundere", "summary": "The Robot You Control is a Tsundere!? is a game where you control a robot girl that's also secretly into you! Fight through hordes of enemies in this roguelite TDS pixelated action shooter game!", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1645156222, "checksum": "5ed3dab5-976a-e0e5-64a8-a70208995c81", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 183413, "created_at": 1638528912, "genres": [31], "name": "The Sun Will Rise Again", "slug": "the-sun-will-rise-again", "summary": "The Sun Will Rise Again is a dark game that explores grief.", "updated_at": 1645431348, "checksum": "dd08c261-ff62-30f2-8c41-1c7444b754c2", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 183445, "created_at": 1638529858, "genres": [34], "name": "The Thorns of War", "slug": "the-thorns-of-war", "summary": "This game is a sequel to the 'The Rose of Segunda'.\nTwo years after the events of 'Rose', Segunda is on the brink of civil war.\nThe disgraced House Stavizzi and the Royal House of Vilquine have been gathered at the city of Garllucio for peace talks in a last ditch attempt to avoid the looming bloodshed.\nPick up the story as Iolanthe di Parisi and navigate this new world of political intrigue and double-dealing.", "themes": [44], "updated_at": 1645495353, "checksum": "41ea73b4-973d-5930-3aee-a5e45adf3a73", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 183201, "created_at": 1638494057, "genres": [12], "name": "The Tyrant's Dream", "slug": "the-tyrants-dream", "summary": "The Tyrant's Dream is a GM-less microgame about the power of prophecy.\nPlay as a Magus in a decadent court, and try to unravel the meaning of your ruler's dreams. Will you be a true prophet, and grasp at the real meaning of the images in the dream? Or will you try and curry favor with the Tyrant, and become their Favourite?", "updated_at": 1645497638, "checksum": "c8601d80-d19f-96ae-6c26-a36982ad1b4a", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 145358, "created_at": 1617352849, "first_release_date": 1617235200, "involved_companies": [123275, 123276], "name": "Green Lava Studios Volume 1", "platforms": [48], "release_dates": [236733], "slug": "green-lava-studios-volume-1", "summary": "All of your favorite Green Lava Studios experiences on one physical disc for the PS4. This is an open pre-order for a limited time. Includes My Name Is Mayo, My Name Is Mayo 2, and Mr. Massagy. \n \nMy Name Is Mayo: Before you judge a mayo, you must walk a mile in its flask! Step into the world of Mayo, as you walk through a philosophical journey that requires tapping like a maniac. In this clicker game maybe you can even open the flask! \n \nMy Name Is Mayo 2: This is a clicker game about a mayonnaise jar. It\u2019s also creamy, dreamy and properly sequel-y! Right in the middle of the Next-Gen hardware hurricane, comes the true next-gen game everyone\u2019s been waiting for! ...Not this one; but it\u2019s close! This... is the touching story about a disorganized Mayo jar, who just can\u2019t get its sheets together. \n \nMr. Massagy: Use your dati