ry about how you are the villain who just killed Super City's favorite superhero, Ultimate Upstander. Now, other villains are knocking at your door, commissioning you to lay out their next trap. What will you do next?", "updated_at": 1648675853, "checksum": "622e143e-743c-e6a0-7d1b-a16b9dceeca2", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 183531, "created_at": 1638537204, "name": "Violent Cheese Crusader", "slug": "violent-cheese-crusader", "summary": "A great dragon attacks the castle and it's up to you as a tough crusader to save... the princess' holy cheese collection! Grab your loyal sword and shield and face the massive dragon... to collect the cheese bit by bit!", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1648712018, "checksum": "6c52e9a2-ffcd-cda2-fa4f-bc319ba189aa", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 125310, "created_at": 1573536464, "first_release_date": 1319673600, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [2, 9, 31], "name": "Resurrection: New Mexico - Collector's Edition", "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [179394], "slug": "resurrection-new-mexico-collectors-edition", "summary": "After a terrible traffic accident Amy Walters finds herself trapped in Resurrection, New Mexico! Now she must work with lost souls to escape the dark and mysterious world that seems to have a mind and a will of its own in this exciting Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game. Can you reach the \"other side\" in time to live again and reunite with your daughter? Find out as you attempt to escape from Resurrection, New Mexico!\n\nThe Collector\u2019s Edition includes:\n- Integrated Strategy Guide\n- Wonderful wallpapers\n- Stunning soundtrack\n- Bonus gameplay", "updated_at": 1648725074, "version_parent": 140146, "version_title": "Collector's Edition", "checksum": "471c9348-f841-0bdd-e1fe-409e2c0f4f67", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 183311, "created_at": 1638518524, "genres": [10, 16], "name": "Ride", "slug": "ride--1", "summary": "Ride is a turn-based infinite runner game.", "updated_at": 1648728242, "checksum": "3756264b-1bbf-5ca2-9461-919a1928dc89", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 194974, "created_at": 1648798698, "first_release_date": 1649289600, "involved_companies": [166716], "name": "Behind the Screen & Defoliation", "platforms": [130], "release_dates": [350966, 350965], "slug": "behind-the-screen-and-defoliation", "storyline": "Behind the Screen\n\n\"Behind The Screen\" is a suspense puzzle action game, set in Taiwan of an age when the internet was still not common, tracing the life of \"a certain murderer\", seeking the truth which has been bent and can no longer be distinguished.\nWhy did the young man who got arrested as his father's murderer have such an ending? Looking back at his childhood, boyhood, and the moments leading up to the incident, the player will face truth and conflict.\nDuring a nervous and mature childhood, incapable of separating reality and dreams, the world started looking like an eerie and fantastic place.\nDuring his boyhood, he condemned the powers that be as an honest student reporter, and to get himself excited, he would impersonate ancient soldiers and politicians.\nDid the young man, who ended up becoming \"a certain murderer\" that day and who still kept resisting, gain anything from facing himself?\n\nThe player will re-experience the murderer's life, solve several mysteries, and search for the truth through the eyes of the murderer.\n\nDefoliation\n\nThe young characters and the old woman, who met through an unfortunate accident, may not have had a good start, but they eventually open up and the youngsters end up visiting the woman at her house as friends. One day, when they are headed to the old woman\u2019s house, as usual, they are suddenly hit by paramnesia. When they wake up, the woman\u2019s house looks different from what they knew.\n\nUnder fear of being watched by someone, they begin their puzzle-solving journey for survival. What are the secrets behind the eternal autumn leaves\u2014the key to the game\u2014and the missing schoolgirl? Can these young characters make it through the game and make it back alive?\n\nIt all starts from searching the house. The player can solve puzzles or look for hints for solving them, by touching the screen or moving the mouse pointer to click on the places they want to search. There are various tricks in the house, and you can move forward as you solve the puzzles along the way. You can also master the use of items to increase the chance of discovering unexpected breakthroughs. Click the Hint Button when you are stuck. It may give you hints about what you may have missed on the screen.", "summary": "Behind the Screen & Defoliation is a suspense puzzle set of games.", "updated_at": 1648800294, "checksum": "3ed0b804-2a7e-72f8-2e26-23a3e1fb90f2", "game_type": 3}, {"id": 183304, "created_at": 1638518154, "genres": [16], "name": "Backyard Fury", "slug": "backyard-fury", "summary": "Summer fun and good times! A casual turn-based game with household items and kids' imagination.", "updated_at": 1648811043, "checksum": "06510c1a-9bd0-b398-9ffb-33526b92d8fd", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 128870, "created_at": 1579937704, "first_release_date": 1329782400, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [33], "involved_companies": [91484], "name": "Bind Her", "platforms": [82], "release_dates": [186923], "slug": "bind-her", "summary": "This is a game based on the idea of 'Qix as bondage'. Although its inception came about by thinking of Qix, it owes more to Jezzball in its mechanics.", "themes": [42], "updated_at": 1649012163, "checksum": "16b67201-ebd4-8d0f-676c-e1bf8da9dade", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 195995, "created_at": 1649169035, "first_release_date": 1539993600, "name": "Amadeus", "parent_game": 166440, "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [351553], "slug": "amadeus", "storyline": "Cornelius Campbell, publicly known by his stage name \"The Amazing Alduin\", is a world famous magician whose career is heading towards a halt. The theaters that will hire him grow ever smaller in size and although the crowd still claps it's but a painful reminder of his former greatness. The crowd has seen it all and Cornelius is prepared to do whatever it takes to make the crowd cheer in awe again. Cornelius sees an opportunity to restore his former success when an item of peculiar origins appears at an auction held in his home town of Colorado Springs.", "summary": "Amadeus is a 2017 partial conversion, community scenario for Amnesia the Dark Descent.", "updated_at": 1649177719, "checksum": "a4035a4e-4115-e11d-ab5b-bf5d9f376ec3", "game_type": 5}, {"id": 138846, "created_at": 1600097330, "first_release_date": 1496016000, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [5], "involved_companies": [108229, 108230], "name": "TNT: Revilution", "parent_game": 46616, "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [210560], "slug": "tnt-revilution", "summary": "TNT: Revilution is a 32-level megawad and unofficial sequel to Final Doom's TNT: Evilution, developed by members of the Doomworld forums and released in 2017. The project had a long and turbulent development dating back to 2009, where it was originally part of TNT 2: Devilution before becoming a separate project led Steve Muller (Kyka) in 2014. After changing hands multiple times, the WAD under the leadership of Micah Petersen (Jaws in Space) was finished and uploaded to the /idgames archive on 29 May, 2017, and was followed by several bugfix patches.", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1649229506, "checksum": "60a5dcb0-4ad4-c407-0d9b-4f1050545836", "game_type": 5}, {"id": 134693, "created_at": 1591983045, "first_release_date": 1509926400, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [13, 32], "involved_companies": [103725], "name": "Sandcastles", "platforms": [82, 6, 39, 14], "release_dates": [203792, 203789, 203790, 203791], "slug": "sandcastles", "summary": "Conjure castles from the sand, watch the sea consume them.", "themes": [33], "updated_at": 1649230982, "checksum": "bad714a8-ea3c-63f8-c997-d87f0028e6f4", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 183237, "created_at": 1638495522, "genres": [12], "name": "Superhuman Industrial and Immaterial, Incorporated", "slug": "superhuman-industrial-and-immaterial-incorporated", "summary": "A short storygame about an average person's day in a city full of superheroes.", "updated_at": 1649231067, "checksum": "7b5cb556-2e81-569c-a784-1d7fd36336e7", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 196649, "created_at": 1649417681, "first_release_date": 1448755200, "genres": [12], "name": "The Eye of the Goddess", "parent_game": 8768, "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [352297], "slug": "the-eye-of-the-goddess", "summary": "New adventures in the world of Drakensang\n\nMalgorra is defeated, Umbracor is free at last. But the next adventure is already waiting.\nWhen they return to Ferdok the heroes are engaged to take an escaped villain into custody.\nDuring their search they give a merchant a helping hand and suddenly events go out of control.\nWho is this mysterious one-eyed man who doesn't even hesitate to murder a Devotee of Praios and what sinister plans does he pursue? What's the matter with Archmage Rakoriums mysterious researches? Is there a connection between the researches and the parts of the figurine which falls into the heroes' hands?\n\nThe Mod \"Eye of the Goddess\" starts directly after the main game and and sends the player on a new journey across the Kosh to experience new adventures and to discover new secrets.", "themes": [17], "updated_at": 1649424845, "checksum": "e7865d82-01fe-d510-c8e4-2aa99345055f", "game_type": 5}, {"id": 145256, "created_at": 1617119912, "first_release_date": 1512691200, "name": "The Assembly / Perfect Double Pack", "platforms": [48], "release_dates": [352423], "slug": "the-assembly-slash-perfect-double-pack", "updated_at": 1649617700, "checksum": "db00a0bd-2130-c706-89ca-382d1547b5d0", "game_type": 3}, {"id": 101094, "created_at": 1525940561, "first_release_date": 1512000000, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [12, 32], "involved_companies": [71651], "name": "Pocket Rogues: Ultimate", "platforms": [34, 39], "release_dates": [353013, 161199], "slug": "pocket-rogues-ultimate", "storyline": "For many centuries, a dark dungeon had been beckoning hapless travelers with its secrets and treasures. One after another, they disappeared after having met the true Evil, but gloomy legends only heat up new and new adventurers\u2019 itches. So why not to become one of them?!\u201d", "summary": "Pocket Rogues is a dynamic old school Action-RPG designed in the Roguelike genre. Here, you have to shoot your way out of hordes of monsters by traveling through unique and randomly generated locations and develop your own fortress and heroes. \n \nReal-time battles will challenge any hardcore player, and research for environment and many unusual techniques will engage you for long hours. \n \nDozens of dungeons filled with unique loot and monsters will be in Pocket Rogues. The game has a lot of heroes for whom you can play, as well as many bosses against whom you will fight, and the battle will be a real test for you. And the traditional components of the RPG genre, such as character upgrade and exploring the world around them, will never let you feel bored! \n \nULTIMATE-VERSION FEATURES: \n \n\u2022 The number of all the crystals, obtained by killing monsters, bosses and for completing tasks, is increased by 50% \n\u2022 Added the ability to save the game before leaving, being in any normal dungeon, as well as auto-save while minimizing the game \n\u2022 Berserk and all future premium classes are available for gold \n\u2022 All normal dungeons are completely free \n\u2022 Advertising is completely disabled", "themes": [17], "updated_at": 1649788224, "version_parent": 111249, "version_title": "Ultimate", "checksum": "cb643b84-a598-7a4d-1abb-a5ad13ca0fef", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 182891, "created_at": 1638412539, "name": "Columns", "slug": "columns--2", "summary": "A VR (and non VR) tech demo and vaporwave art experience directed by Mercurius FM.", "updated_at": 1649959723, "checksum": "3c96b883-4972-be41-6a7f-add71