e your massive size and firepower to compete with others in a quest to become a god. Immersed in the conflict of an ancient world, you will need to use a combination of teamwork and skill to survive. Fight for supremacy on the fields of battle using free locomotion, strategy, and destructible environments. Define your own style of combat by customizing your abilities so that you can vanquish your foes and push your disciples to victory.\n\nThe Complete Edition also includes all the DLCs!", "themes": [1, 17], "updated_at": 1659033100, "version_parent": 75246, "version_title": "Complete Edition", "checksum": "28ff4d98-4415-1dd6-8e91-d4fbec2cb34f", "game_status": 8, "game_type": 0}, {"id": 146165, "created_at": 1619101429, "first_release_date": 1625184000, "genres": [5, 13], "involved_companies": [140275], "name": "Red Wings: Aces of the Sky - Baron Edition", "platforms": [48, 130], "release_dates": [240387, 240386], "slug": "red-wings-aces-of-the-sky-baron-edition", "summary": "Experience the fascinating history of the Great War and become the king of the skies! Red Wings: Aces of the Sky is a dynamic action game that will show you amazing battles from the pages of the history in a brand new arcade gameplay style. Use your unique skills to take your opponents down, develop your deadly pilot aim and become the true ace of the sky.\n\nRed Wings: Aces of the Sky Baron Edition includes:\n- Base Game\n- Art Book\n- Poster", "themes": [1, 22, 39], "updated_at": 1659059332, "version_parent": 121768, "version_title": "Baron Edition", "checksum": "0de9be8d-9e15-d59f-6e6d-e771821f7133", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 25334, "created_at": 1477903811, "first_release_date": 1461196800, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [31, 32], "involved_companies": [41275], "name": "Jackal", "platforms": [6], "rating": 30.0, "rating_count": 0, "release_dates": [59872], "slug": "jackal--2", "summary": "This is a story about a man who finds himself in a difficult situation and urgently needs money, so he take