d of the game, the player is greeted with a photorealistic shot of the country club lodge against the setting sun and surrounded by trees.", "updated_at": 1662238023, "checksum": "3e1eb14f-c47e-51c9-c222-a61d3f518df4", "game_type": 11}, {"id": 215362, "created_at": 1662369315, "first_release_date": 1624320000, "genres": [5, 32, 33], "name": "SturmFront: The Mutant War - Farewell Edition", "platforms": [46], "release_dates": [386651, 386652], "slug": "sturmfront-the-mutant-war-farewell-edition", "summary": "Purge mutants with your flamethrower in this twin-stick arcade shooter, as you make your way across a derelict cityscape fuelled by the sounds of heavy metal and psychedelic Electronica!", "themes": [1, 18], "updated_at": 1662370751, "version_parent": 15394, "version_title": "Farewell Edition", "checksum": "a19aa96c-d012-e788-7aac-d214c30998e8", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 215945, "created_at": 1662587139, "game_modes": [1], "name": "The Big Comfy Couch", "platforms": [11], "release_dates": [387185], "slug": "the-big-comfy-couch", "summary": "The Big Comfy Couch is a cancelled game for the Xbox.", "updated_at": 1662601510, "checksum": "2f9e2e4b-f3bf-d792-aee5-afe53e3a3346", "game_status": 6, "game_type": 0}, {"id": 152910, "created_at": 1624180847, "first_release_date": 1557446400, "involved_companies": [139602], "name": "Diesel Brothers: Truck Building Simulator Editor", "parent_game": 105264, "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [291895], "slug": "diesel-brothers-truck-building-simulator-editor", "summary": "Tuning trucks is all about eye-catching designs.\n\nWhen you're in the need for a particular part, but just can't find it anywhere in the shop - make it yourself! Impress your customers and fan followers with one of a kind rims, astonishing exhaust tips, and other unique parts.", "updated_at": 1662692289, "checksum": "b8e69aaa-6181-84e1-65a4-fcf03cecdabf", "game_type": 5}, {"id": 216338, "created_at": 1662858469, "first_release_date": 1163376000, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [25], "name": "Katana", "parent_game": 196251, "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [387862], "slug": "katana", "storyline": "Katana draws you into the violent and chaotic world of an Assassin on the run: - from his Order; from the shattered remains of his past; and from the haunting screams of the countless people he's murdered. Competing for his severed head are the very people he used to work with - Mercenaries, Assassins, Ninja, and good old fashioned Psychopaths. The worst mankind has to offer.", "summary": "Heavily influenced by popular Japanese Anime and recent movies such as Kill Bill; Katana combines Max Payne's stylish Bullet-Time with stunning, yet brutal, bladed-weapon combat. Developed by Maddieman and StratonAce, with help and support from Kenneth Yeung, Katana lifts the Max Payne engine to new heights and takes the player to new levels of pain.", "themes": [1, 18], "updated_at": 1662948240, "checksum": "d7a03d29-cdd5-ee4a-0bbc-159bcc5ca7a1", "game_type": 5}, {"id": 193557, "created_at": 1646704791, "genres": [15, 32], "name": "Fall In love 2", "slug": "fall-in-love-2", "summary": "Created by \"Origin team\", \"FALL IN LOVE2\" is a very classic game of finding the differences, coupled with beautiful pictures and beautiful girls with unique characteristics, it will definitely bring you a very exciting experience!", "themes": [42], "updated_at": 1663059656, "checksum": "95510d54-da05-d8f2-bca5-ec2e28bfa11d", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 122610, "created_at": 1569506729, "first_release_date": 1569283200, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [12, 15, 32], "involved_companies": [89264, 89265], "name": "Zero Fantasy: Kanon", "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [183740], "slug": "zero-fantasy-kanon", "themes": [17, 42], "updated_at": 1663067494, "checksum": "3236567d-19c2-624b-969d-dfd69f5599b8", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 206364, "created_at": 1656072440, "first_release_date": 915062400, "involved_companies": [186893, 186892, 186964, 186965], "name": "Nintendo Mini