33-3d7c-08a515582711", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 74056, "created_at": 1507207738, "first_release_date": 820368000, "game_modes": [1, 2], "genres": [2, 15], "involved_companies": [88684], "name": "Caribbean Disaster", "platforms": [13, 16], "release_dates": [182012], "slug": "caribbean-disaster", "storyline": "Somewhere in the ocean is a little island, inhabited by a President and three ministers of the air force, navy, and army. The island also has ten other resident citizens. Every morning the President receives money from the American and Russian embassies, which can be given to the ministers or spent to improve the President\u2019s residence in the Arctic.\n\nWhen two of the three ministers vote against the President, there is a vote of non-confidence and an election happens. Now the player has to convince the population of their leadership abilities, using the unique skills of special contacts: the chief of the Secret Police, for example, arrests political enemies (the ministers), the radio disc jockey spreads false news and the priest sells weapons.\n\nThree types of weapons also enter into these negotiations - tanks, zeppelins and submarines, one fitting each of the Defense ministries. After every round the player can attack their political enemies in a very military fashion.", "summary": "Are you looking for carefree holiday pleasures in a tropical island paradise? Do you like to sip ice-cold Pina Coladas from cocktail glasses with small colorful umbrellas? Do you dream of dozing under the palm trees on the sandy beach? If your answer is yes to any of these, Caribbean Disaster is the game for you. Caribbean Disaster is a savvy strategy game that breaks the mold of the genre, gets your brain working at peak performance, and pushes your sense of humor to the limit. The game features scrollable island views with variable zoom, animated locations, and complex strategy game-play.", "themes": [27], "updated_at": 1670948438, "checksum": "7441058a-4d15-267b-1377-2c6b0bdf7eb5", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 79559, "created_at": 1514589376, "name": "Helsingfors", "slug": "helsingfors", "updated_at": 1670948439, "checksum": "6030288e-fc71-a00e-723d-afbec7d18618", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 79750, "created_at": 1514599701, "name": "Squigs", "slug": "squigs", "updated_at": 1670948449, "checksum": "2d21f763-4bec-1741-bd8c-3cbad26fd11d", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 74060, "created_at": 1507207754, "name": "Magic Lanterns", "slug": "magic-lanterns", "summary": "Magic Lanterns is a casual game developed and published by Boomzap Pte. Ltd.", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670948456, "checksum": "63acf3f2-179d-6eb0-ad57-daae6f249658", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 100078, "created_at": 1525004628, "first_release_date": 1009756800, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [33], "involved_companies": [75653], "name": "Kartoffelp\u00fcree: Der Gem\u00fcse-Shooter", "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [166477], "slug": "kartoffelpuree-der-gemuse-shooter", "summary": "Hordes of vegetables are threatening the earth. Attacking with carrots, green and red pepper and many other units they seek to conquer the planet and enslave the human race. You are given a ship and send out into space to take the fight back to them.", "updated_at": 1670948462, "checksum": "12d24b07-774e-9a22-55ea-c469699bfad3", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 137502, "created_at": 1598614453, "name": "All You Can Play: 10 Action-Games", "slug": "all-you-can-play-10-action-games", "updated_at": 1670948462, "checksum": "5b031fde-b365-fb4e-da76-cd68244790d2", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 80062, "created_at": 1515178460, "first_release_date": 873072000, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [15], "involved_companies": [188975, 188976], "name": "Conquest Earth: First Encounter", "platforms": [13], "release_dates": [392818], "slug": "conquest-earth-first-encounter", "summary": "This RTS (real-time strategy) game tells the story of a futuristic war between the humans and the inhabitants of Jupiter (Jovians). The player can choose to command the armies of either side. Humans and Jovians have different menu layouts and tactics which they can employ for offensive and defensive actions. Also, the Jovians must deal with the atmosphere of the Earth, which obstructs their view, by using special troops; the humans also face a problem in the sulphur shrouds of Jupiter.\n\nThe game implements its own view system for battles. Some may know it from their TV's - there's a picture-in-picture option to view 3 different locations at the same time. You can choose from two modes of play, normal RTS, or a more complicated variant which is just playable if you're confident with the manual.", "themes": [1, 18], "updated_at": 1670948464, "checksum": "b64a161f-8bed-23a4-e441-be41ab1625b9", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 100077, "created_at": 1525004623, "name": "Beau Jolly 48K Value Pack", "slug": "beau-jolly-48k-value-pack", "updated_at": 1670948478, "checksum": "939dee65-ad10-1c2b-bb17-0e428244c48a", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 137022, "created_at": 1598266678, "name": "D.N.A.", "slug": "dna--1", "updated_at": 1670948489, "checksum": "22d0804d-433c-c63a-f350-3e3404530999", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 94396, "created_at": 1521401348, "name": "Baseball Mogul 2003", "slug": "baseball-mogul-2003", "updated_at": 1670948496, "checksum": "b34e3105-0050-01ae-f3f1-7ed260d7d795", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 74050, "created_at": 1507207721, "name": "Minebot Arena", "slug": "minebot-arena", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670948513, "checksum": "c291edff-64f6-2d17-6473-d3ab083eb7e0", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 137377, "created_at": 1598606321, "name": "Ghost Hunter", "slug": "ghost-hunter", "updated_at": 1670948522, "checksum": "db212d62-989f-a424-8b6a-a30c61b0f0e3", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 80076, "created_at": 1515180587, "first_release_date": 975974400, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [31], "hypes": 1, "involved_companies": [92663], "name": "Riddle of the Sphinx: An Egyptian Adventure", "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [227976], "slug": "riddle-of-the-sphinx