 your own home thanks to Data Design Interactive - a successful video games publisher and games developer, who today announced a new title to be added to their Nintendo Wii label, Popcorn Arcade, kidz Sports - Crazy Mini Golf. DDI have incorporated two game styles; for first timers it's a case of hitting the A bottom when you are lined up, then moving your arm up and down before hitting the B bottom - simple. If you fancy a real challenge, you could try the Sim version where the hitting of the ball and its strength is down to you - once mastered, you will feel like a putting green King... Play through 74 crazy holes set over 4 wacky courses in Crazy Mini Golf.", "updated_at": 1670953418, "checksum": "12c36dcf-6bdf-17bd-121d-70195fb79afa", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 92024, "created_at": 1521188778, "name": "Adventure Generation Online", "slug": "adventure-generation-online", "updated_at": 1670953427, "checksum": "4697d518-8a11-3ad0-6cb8-d4f62cc6febd", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 92047, "created_at": 1521189268, "name": "Jonny Crush", "slug": "jonny-crush", "updated_at": 1670953433, "checksum": "7024a52f-743b-4208-3df2-ba2e5bbcb28f", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 47770, "created_at": 1499880974, "first_release_date": 1289606400, "name": "Logic Machines", "platforms": [20], "release_dates": [94398], "slug": "logic-machines", "summary": "Set forth on a quest to become a puzzle master! Use your keen sense of logic and the Laws of Physics to solve brain teasing puzzles.", "updated_at": 1670953447, "checksum": "a788ca42-3eec-5609-754b-c5d475902396", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 90920, "created_at": 1520956412, "name": "Milo and Kate", "slug": "milo-and-kate", "updated_at": 1670953447, "checksum": "e398eba6-74fc-68d9-aa2f-17ac68e729ca", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 68073, "created_at": 1505484026, "name": "Girls Life: Strass & Diamonds", "slug": "girls-life-strass-and-diamonds", "summary": "no info", "updated_at": 1670953461, "checksum": "41f6188b-ef70-f1e7-bb27-80e6ed1bea0e", "game_type": 0}, {"