ures with human DNA. The procedure is mostly used as a last result, as most of the time it results in abnormalities and disfigurations. \n \nOn a few rare occasions, the altering of DNA has yielded some highly desired results, where the balance of human DNA with genes from a single animal resulted in aesthetically pleasing specimens \u2014 some even attractive / good looking creatures. These lucky ones have become overnight sensations living a life of public attention \u2014 nicknamed Anthro Influencers. Little does the public know about the reality of their contracts with Big Corp Inc., the world\u2019s leading company in DNA altering, who claims to have full control over the results. Big Corp Inc. is looking to change the public perceptions of DNA altering by sponsoring an Anthro-only tournament as a PR stunt, and you are invited to join! \n \nPlay as Kimmy Frog, Johnny Cockhead, Foxy BonBon, Lab-Rat Perry or as Piggy Smith (the first 5 Anthro Influencers revealed out of the 12 character roster) and blast your way to freedom!", "updated_at": 1670956303, "checksum": "12cb6c83-a6d5-ba2c-60f1-db23a451d682", "game_status": 2, "game_type": 0}, {"id": 137765, "created_at": 1598628882, "name": "Ashes of Eden: Survival", "slug": "ashes-of-eden-survival", "updated_at": 1670956308, "checksum": "4839e7e2-b78f-0ccb-479b-fc71013f1bb9", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 137779, "created_at": 1598629011, "name": "Typrx", "slug": "typrx", "updated_at": 1670956314, "checksum": "a332b8f1-0a9b-3a10-d0ae-f4ec9078133f", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 137776, "created_at": 1598628901, "name": "Brasfoot 2020", "slug": "brasfoot-2020", "updated_at": 1670956328, "checksum": "6e8fc32d-4e46-c2c9-3eb4-07292d9864d1", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 137820, "created_at": 1598629459, "name": "Minisaga", "slug": "minisaga", "updated_at": 1670956329, "checksum": "b70f24bb-13b3-aade-f0ce-7ab48557f7c8", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 137807, "created_at": 1598629420, "name": "Beauty and the Beast: Hidden Object Fairy Tale", "slug