 would draw its graphics line-by-line and slowly fill in the colors, a long process that would need to be done anytime the scene changed to a new image. Demons Ring, on the other hand, could transition to different images in under half a second, a feature that was heavily advertised by Falcom and something that would eventually become a standard for the genre moving forward.", "themes": [19], "updated_at": 1670968815, "checksum": "686af286-2f43-4150-d2e5-416f43a81b2a", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 112176, "created_at": 1542355489, "name": "Rising Evil VR", "slug": "rising-evil-vr", "updated_at": 1670968836, "checksum": "6a4fc583-412a-6761-b9e9-62c3eed24b57", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 107492, "created_at": 1535958399, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [13, 15, 32], "involved_companies": [72380], "name": "Break the Blocks", "slug": "break-the-blocks", "summary": "Break the blocks is a simple but very enjoyable game for all the people that want to experience a retro videogame experience while they have lots of fun.", "updated_at": 1670968839, "checksum": "f5fb2d6a-9079-5c13-a673-662120ed5421", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 112173, "created_at": 1542355463, "name": "Package Handler VR", "slug": "package-handler-vr", "updated_at": 1670968839, "checksum": "19a80ed9-b4b2-c1a4-c4e8-89f581f81494", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 112187, "created_at": 1542360348, "name": "Zombie Redbox", "slug": "zombie-redbox", "updated_at": 1670968841, "checksum": "246e748b-0f45-6d8e-4f96-037e3e405524", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 112188, "created_at": 1542360349, "name": "International Wrestling Simulator 2018", "slug": "international-wrestling-simulator-2018", "updated_at": 1670968841, "checksum": "6c0cb324-7688-4c82-ab9d-b712f525f8ef", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 112179, "created_at": 1542360262, "name": "Infinity Land", "slug": "infinity-land", "updated_at": 1670968846, "checksum": "6731fc44-12c2-8703-1eec-72b1829578b8", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 112170, "created_at": 1542355437, "name": "Chromasia Rock Paper Tactics", "s