57e626", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 80296, "created_at": 1515203238, "name": "Rising Sun: Imperial Strike", "slug": "rising-sun-imperial-strike", "updated_at": 1670971755, "checksum": "4b8b231c-f063-f409-caf5-40e659613c38", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 15088, "created_at": 1449684016, "first_release_date": 662601600, "game_modes": [1, 2], "genres": [9, 33], "involved_companies": [29065], "name": "Jumping Jack'Son", "platforms": [63, 16], "release_dates": [41817, 41818], "slug": "jumping-jackson", "updated_at": 1670971782, "checksum": "b0134153-d181-4019-3004-25f415a00f06", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 80275, "created_at": 1515202719, "name": "Flight Assignment: Airline Transport Pilot", "slug": "flight-assignment-airline-transport-pilot", "updated_at": 1670971792, "checksum": "011208a8-e3f7-d72a-7556-e1bb748833d1", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 13075, "created_at": 1443287527, "first_release_date": 631065600, "game_modes": [1, 2, 4], "genres": [5], "involved_companies": [27185], "name": "Protector", "platforms": [16, 25], "release_dates": [37525, 37526], "slug": "protector", "updated_at": 1670971801, "checksum": "025a6af4-43e8-dc00-5465-e2964b63c6c6", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 12342, "created_at": 1441469382, "first_release_date": 599529600, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [5], "involved_companies": [26260], "name": "Tank Command", "platforms": [60], "release_dates": [35270], "slug": "tank-command", "summary": "Tank Command is a vertically scrolling action game. You control a tank on a mission to capture the enemy flag as well as earn as many points as possible. To do this, you will need to blast your way through their defenses on three levels of increasing difficulty. Blocking your progress are enemy tanks, pillboxes, missiles, jeeps, infantry, huts, and more, all of which earn you points when destroyed. Your tank is equipped with a limited amount of fuel and ammo, however it can be replenished occasionally by collecting the bonus icons when they appear on the screen. If you can make it past all of the obstacles and capture the flag, then you win the game! \n \nThe 7800 is pretty much void of super-rare games like the 2600'?s Tooth Protectors and Chase the Chuckwagon, but don't worry, tracking down Tank Command in a box will cost you a pretty penny. As far as gameplay goes, Tank Command is not going to blow anyone away. Here you have a vertical scroller like Commando or Ikari Warriors minus the charm, quality level design, and reasonable difficulty. There are only three levels in the game, but just like its Froggo cousin Water Ski, the difficulty ramps so severely after the mindless first level that continuing takes strong will. The pink terrain is a bit odd, as well. Tank Command was only released in NTSC format.", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670971840, "checksum": "ee72838e-1117-f94e-2625-4cbb4dcae57d", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 15921, "created_at": 1452614641, "first_release_date": 599529600, "name": "Crystal Hammer", "platforms": [16], "release_dates": [43664], "slug": "crystal-hammer", "summary": "An excellent Arkanoid clone.", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670971840, "checksum": "6900a482-2b7c-434e-4f4a-f9b8152717bc", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 25156, "created_at": 1477239956, "first_release_date": 384566400, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [33], "involved_companies": [41006], "name": "Astro-Dodge", "platforms": [13], "release_dates": [59440], "slug": "astro-dodge", "summary": "In this Asteroids clone, you get points by shooting enemy ships, and asteroids which gradually break down into smaller and smaller pieces. Your controls are rotating clockwise or counter-clockwise, thrusting, firing, and hyperspace. As you progress, the levels will get more and more difficult as you move into areas with more and more asteroids.", "themes": [1, 18], "updated_at": 1670971873, "checksum": "757efa6f-91a2-9298-a4b4-82654e1869b0", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 13573, "created_at": 1445017450, "first_release_date": 536371200, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [9, 33], "involved_companies": [48726, 48727], "name": "Deactivators", "platforms": [15, 26, 25], "release_dates": [76301, 76300, 76299], "slug": "deactivators", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670971899, "checksum": "5b887595-0873-c93f-b9fa-76e3816ca708", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 20723, "aggregated_rating": 50.0, "aggregated_rating_count": 1, "created_at": 1468868648, "first_release_date": 847670400, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [14], "name": "Pitball", "platforms": [7], "release_dates": [212971], "slug": "pitball", "summary": "Pitball is a Sports game, developed by Time Warner Interactive and published by Accolade, which was released in 1996.", "total_rating": 50.0, "total_rating_count": 1, "updated_at": 1670972005, "checksum": "0da0dd46-7702-5f48-1b9d-1ab8ccd3c5f0", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 100118, "created_at": 1525005456, "name": "Tribes Action Pack", "slug": "tribes-action-pack", "updated_at": 1670972023, "checksum": "c7756a4e-b6b7-99b7-30b4-254deea0721f", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 14439, "created_at": 1446815536, "name": "Tunneler", "slug": "tunneler", "summary": "Tunneler is the better known game by Geoffrey Silverton (the other one is Popgames). Two players using the same keyboard and the same screen each control an underground tank. Goal is to find and destroy the opponent's tank. Since only small part of the map is displayed on the split screen, you might actually have some searching to do.", "updated_at": 1670972026, "checksum": "28a72b60-c028-4fbc-6ba2-74e1117e5964", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 15569, "created_at": 1451520616, "name": "XP8", "slug": "xp8", "summary": "In the cold darkness, the alien probe drifts into the outer reaches of the star system, drawn by the star's gravity. For days it continues unnoticed, its power systems long ago burnt out...\n\nFinally it crosses the outer system ring, and triggers a series of automatic warnings.\n\nOn the homeworld, a computer console hums to life, beginning a chain of events that eventually lead to interstellar war...", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670972027, "checksum": "0dc43a9b-2cb4-bd1e-fac6-bd01f81690d7", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 137020, "created_at": 1598266322, "name": "Caillou: Four Seasons of Fun", "slug": "caillou-four-seasons-of-fun", "themes": [35], "updated_at": 1670972035, "checksum": "a68beb4a-b700-421d-ceeb-fe512d82a8da", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 12651, "created_at": 1442504601, "first_release_date": 662601600, "game_modes": [1, 2], "genres": [5], "involved_companies": [28080], "name": "Kamikaze", "platforms": [16], "release_dates": [36270], "slug": "kamikaze", "summary": "Using buttons to move left, right and fire, you attempt to ward off invading aliens and their flying saucers. The aliens are dropped off from a saucer and stored in multiple columns until a column is full, then the aliens in that column descend, one by one, and attack. Also, the saucers sometimes descend to attack; if they are not destroyed, one ship is lost.", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670972078, "checksum": "80626dc8-3798-6138-a1a9-4f3470a136e2", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 92930, "created_at": 1521205996, "name": "Subway Scramble", "slug": "subway-scramble", "updated_at": 1670972084, "checksum": "98a342a3-d659-8f73-0a4e-c59cce3f9a0d", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 100128, "created_at": 1525006133, "name": "Virtual Reality Vol. 2", "slug": "virtual-reality-vol-2", "updated_at": 1670972142, "checksum": "aa8e8449-45af-fde2-dbf4-eb454a1ff45b", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 75117, "created_at": 1509290544, "first_release_date": 631065600, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [33], "involved_companies": [56649], "name": "Navy Seal", "platforms": [15, 13], "release_dates": [125323, 125322], "slug": "navy-seal", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670972163, "checksum": "8a93502d-b3f3-2509-a5f7-b8cf3097089e", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 15539, "created_at": 1451245137, "first_release_date": 536371200, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [4], "involved_companies": [52660], "name": "Master Ninja", "platforms": [15, 13, 16], "release_dates": [101426, 101427, 101425], "slug": "master-ninja", "summary": "Shadow Warrior of Death. \n \nWelcome to the adventure of a lifetime. Prepare yourself for the most awesome and dangerous challenge ever. Enter the mystic land of Japan as it was centuries ago. Assume the identify of a proud Ninja warrior and ready yourself to enter the castle of the evil Japanese Warlord. Sanjo Yama Moto. Your quest is to regain a precious magical sword that Sanjo has stolen from your Ninja sect. This sword has power that Sanjo can use to being death and destruction to the land. The danger in Sanjo's castle will be tremendous. Through the castle lurk powerful Ninja warriors, Samurai guards, evil mystic priests, and deadly tigers. You must work your way through the many chambers of Sanjo's castle, flight and kill his Ninjas, battle his black magic curses, overcome his traps and obstacles, recapture the magic sword, and assassinate Sanjo Yama Moto himself. No Ninja has ever survived the destructive forces of Sanjo. Are you the one who can finally battle the dark power and bring truth and goodness back to the land? Are you the one who has no fear? Are you the one that will be called... Master Ninja?", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670972216, "checksum": "27272c2b-69d5-1695-c049-6e193170efa7", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 10846, "created_at": 1433078845, "first_release_date": 578448000, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [25, 33], "involved_companies": [54078, 54077], "name": "Manhattan Dealers", "platforms": [63, 13, 16], "release_dates": [112276, 112277, 112278], "slug": "manhattan-dealers", "summary": "You're Dirty Harry and you need to find and beat up dealers to get drugs and burn them outside the town, which will regain your energy. This is the Silmarils' first game. In 9 screens, you can fight with ninjas, amazons, punks and other thugs and low-lives, and you've only your hands and feets for that !You start in a street, a punk in front of you, beat him him up and he'll drop his drugs, continue to the stairs to find a guy with a chainsaw, beat him and keep his drugs. Go outside town to burn the drugs in a barrel to regain life and return to the dark side to make the streets safer.", "themes": [1, 20], "updated_at": 1670972267, "checksum": "df83e83e-e8d6-1b44-0490-7db3bb903a1e", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 14064, "created_at": 1445414420, "first_release_date": 567907200, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [9, 31], "involved_companies": [51946], "name": "The Fifth Quadrant", "platforms": [15, 26, 25], "release_dates": [93033, 93034, 93035], "slug": "the-fifth-quadrant", "themes": [1, 18], "updated_at": 1670972316, "checksum": "6531e08f-36cc-a8d1-fe5a-c3ffb1dd290a", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 14329, "created_at": 1445932063, "first_release_date": 757296000, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [33], "involved_companies": [27822], "name": "Bob's Bad Day", "platforms": [16], "release_dates": [40188], "slug": "bobs-bad-day", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670972329, "checksum": "d7905431-f2cd-1b1f-c304-ed98266bf901", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 12795, "created_at": 1442691123, "first_release_date": 631065600, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [2, 31], "involved_companies": [56204, 56203], "name": "The Third Courier", "platforms": [115, 63, 13, 16], "release_dates": [124192, 124191, 124193, 124194], "slug": "the-third-courier", "summary": "The Third Courier is set in the era of the 'cold war', and the action takes place in Germany. The player is an American spy, and his mission is to recover stolen NATO defense plans.\n\nYou will have to explore the city streets, with the aid of taxis and the Autobahn. Talk to important people and buy key objects, and then sneak around spying on anyone who seems suspicious. Encounters with enemy agents, muggers and tramps can turn violent; when they do, use your gun quickly to ensure they are shot first.", "themes": [1, 20, 43], "updated_at": 1670972371, "checksum": "77c52dc9-54db-dfe7-7ba8-6ca1d25c2ae4", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 94895, "created_at": 1521487665, "name": "New Supaplex", "slug": "new-supaplex", "updated_at": 1670972583, "checksum": "1af2547f-7a57-e987-cc9e-b25ef82bc2c2", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 14035, "created_at": 1445367136, "name": "Disco Dan", "platforms": [26], "release_dates": [39647], "slug": "disco-dan", "summary": "Arcade style game for ZX Spectrum. Features 2 game styles: dodge enemies while runnning down a tunnel, and change the tile colors, Q*bert style", "updated_at": 1670972597, "checksum": "9d5cd919-204f-8400-d5eb-9b0cc84739e0", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 7059, "created_at": 1401295890, "first_release_date": 1147824000, "game_modes": [1, 2, 4], "genres": [14], "involved_companies": [16691], "name": "Love Football", "platforms": [12], "release_dates": [17685], "slug": "love-football", "updated_at": 1670972665, "checksum": "db7a5762-09ce-c8e5-6e1c-a0426a6b6b2d", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 12567, "created_at": 1442351891, "first_release_date": 662601600, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [15], "name": "Debut: Planet Simulation", "platforms": [16], "release_dates": [36050], "slug": "debut-planet-simulation", "updated_at": 1670972676, "checksum": "93d67194-e91e-c9c5-a6b9-8b744209b32f", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 18604, "created_at": 1459631756, "first_release_date": 378604800, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [33], "involved_companies": [54830], "name": "Videocart-26: Alien Invasion", "platforms": [127], "release_dates": [114312], "slug": "videocart-26-alien-invasion", "summary": "In this Space Invaders variant, the player controls a gun turret at the bottom of the screen and fires missiles at incoming alien ships. The turret can move both left and right and hide behind three protective barriers. The alien invaders move left and right, fire missiles at the player, and slowly approach the planet surface - if they land, the player loses the game. Every once in a while, an alien mothership will fly across the top of the screen and shooting it will give the player extra points. The goal of the game is to destroy all alien ships in each attacking wave and score as many points as possible. The game ends when players lose their three lives.", "themes": [18], "updated_at": 1670972755, "checksum": "28117247-56b4-5015-d963-4dbfab8f7f81", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 68017, "created_at": 1505480952, "first_release_date": 1153958400, "involved_companies": [107059], "name": "Zegapain XOR", "platforms": [12], "release_dates": [208796], "slug": "zegapain-xor", "summary": "Zegapain XOR was released in Japan on July 27, 2006. The game is similar in nature to Zone of the Enders. A mech action game, the player controls Cerebrant Toga Vital and the plot runs parallel to the events of the anime. Zegapain XOR is set on the Oceanus-class ship Dvaraka and commanded by Isola, a recurring character in the anime series. Several characters who appear in the game make brief appearances in the anime series.", "updated_at": 1670972778, "checksum": "e4297807-29b0-7d99-8ce9-1ffe5ce80cbe", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 68015, "created_at": 1505480946, "first_release_date": 1165449600, "involved_companies": [107060], "name": "Zegapain NOT", "platforms": [12], "release_dates": [208797], "slug": "zegapain-not", "summary": "Zegapain NOT, was released on December 7, 2006 in Japan. Also based on the anime series, Zegapain NOT is a sequel and companion to Zegapain XOR and continues the storyline of the previous game. The game features a special online mode that allows for cross-disc online play, enabling players with Zegapain XOR to play against players with Zegapain NOT. The game has over 3,000 ways to customize your character.", "updated_at": 1670972779, "checksum": "c41dcf5e-6785-0069-7cd3-09f682f37c2c", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 67850, "created_at": 1505474080, "name": "Smash it Up!", "slug": "smash-it-up", "summary": "Smash it Up! by Tag Games", "updated_at": 1670972812, "checksum": "65c7f6e8-c19a-8452-c6dc-3f4186f27877", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 67832, "created_at": 1505473930, "name": "The Galactic Aquarium", "slug": "the-galactic-aqu