ed_at": 1670973126, "checksum": "ec6dd55a-aec0-e6ed-f8fa-a47a5b896e57", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 66197, "created_at": 1505324718, "genres": [14], "name": "Yakyuu Dou: The Way to Gloria", "slug": "yakyuu-dou-the-way-to-gloria", "summary": "Baseball game developed by Nihon Create in 1989.", "updated_at": 1670973127, "checksum": "9ea4c75a-9970-fb2b-1077-fc799428b85c", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 65960, "created_at": 1505309692, "name": "Endless Midnight: Zombie Swarm", "slug": "endless-midnight-zombie-swarm", "summary": "Blast your way through a horde of zombies with a top-notch arsenal! Compete for high scores and gain a variety of medals through challenging game modes.", "updated_at": 1670973194, "checksum": "0b0633b0-e3e0-e1f2-9bf6-eb9fa4d70b35", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 21703, "aggregated_rating": 72.0, "aggregated_rating_count": 1, "created_at": 1469795583, "first_release_date": 612662400, "genres": [5], "name": "The Next Space", "platforms": [52], "release_dates": [91271], "slug": "the-next-space", "summary": "The Next Space is a vertically scrolling Shoot 'em Up released in 1989 by SNK for Arcades. The game is a typical scrolling shooter, with two buttons used for the primary shot and secondary shot respectively. Red capsules will leave \"S\" icons which will raise the ship's speed. Along the way the player will also find blue capsules which will release power-ups which equip different secondary shots into the ship. There are nine different secondary shots available, each represented by a different letter. By shooting the power-up icons the player will cycle between the letters, allowing to equip the desired weapon. Weapons don't stack, so picking up more icons of the same letter won't raise the player's firepower.", "total_rating": 72.0, "total_rating_count": 1, "updated_at": 1670973201, "checksum": "58780a0e-b73f-5162-19d3-9d58eff3f062", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 65914, "created_at": 1505305794, "name": "Thrill Drive 2", "slug": "thrill-drive-2", "summary": "An arcade racing game, where you race through traffic. You get a score based on how much damage your accidents cause.", "updated_at": 1670973208, "checksum": "dde0c3b3-1906-468b-cd2a-ec459d89670a", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 65884, "created_at": 1505305216, "first_release_date": 987033600, "name": "The Sword of Camelot", "platforms": [7], "release_dates": [371547], "slug": "the-sword-of-camelot", "summary": "In The Sword of Camelot you will find a variety of mini-games targeted for young children. Though, the game also has the peculiarity of having more of a cinematic feel, rather than playable portions.", "themes": [22], "updated_at": 1670973229, "checksum": "5f436c82-bfe4-ab86-ced7-10f18e17b144", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 9451, "created_at": 1428188660, "name": "Towing Simulator", "slug": "towing-simulator", "summary": "You are the owner of a large, very unpopular parking area and an armada of breakdown trucks for large as well as small vehicles. With this kind of work you can make good money, because car owners have to pay a pretty penny to redeem their car. So it's high time to get on the gravy train.\nBut watch out - you have to drive the tow truck yourself and in narrow streets car body damage happens too easily. Such incidents are not only annoying but also expensive. Only those who get their job done quickly and accident-free can expand their business.", "updated_at": 1670973235, "checksum": "0610da61-ab2c-4e49-12e9-096b3c22c677", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 10405, "created_at": 1431951051, "name": "Heavyweight Transport Simulator", "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [371761], "slug": "heavyweight-transport-simulator", "summary": "As a haulier focused on heavy transports there is no transport problem you can\u2019t deal with. Whether \"normal\" heavy cargo or loads of more than 400 tonnes (800 000 pounds), you transport each single freight safely to its destination. Powerful tractor units in different classes of load capacities and the required, matching semi-trailers are loaded in delivery order. Even in the event of special transports with unusual and challenging dimensions you keep cool and calm and know exactly how to remove obstacles, such as signs and stones efficiently from the road.\n\nGood planning is the basis for a smooth work flow. Therefore careful preparation of the routes, precise time management and the gauging of loading and unloading facilities are among the routine tasks of your team. But only if you are aware of all the possible challenges will you be able to work uninterrupted!", "updated_at": 1670973235, "checksum": "9371f0fc-0f36-dae7-87d0-b5ca69036ce1", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 10778, "created_at": 1432986046, "name": "Road Works Simulator", "slug": "road-works-simulator", "summary": "You are responsible for the streets and roads in your city. With so many people in a city, there is always the need for new living space, which has to be opened up with roads. In addition, the residents ask here and there for wider and faster roads. Under certain circumstances you get contracts for plaster work, the creation of pedestrian and bike paths, or the replacement of gas, water and power lines in existing roads.\n\nFor a realistic representation, a 3D graphics engine is used, which represents the events at any time clearly and realistically. Step by step the player gains experience and thus more extensive special orders. A level is considered to be solved, if within the specified time, the given tasks have been fulfilled. But be careful, unpredictable events always affect the current happenings.", "updated_at": 1670973235, "checksum": "78fd971a-3d76-3968-c02b-2ccabddcfa73", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 92566, "created_at": 1521202033, "name": "Spidercide", "slug": "spidercide", "updated_at": 1670973254, "checksum": "068fceb5-83ac-df1f-daca-26fa60ae7ad9", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 26379, "created_at": 1481383128, "first_release_date": 536371200, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [8, 9], "involved_companies": [42721, 42722], "name": "Mind Walker", "platforms": [16], "release_dates": [62453], "slug": "mind-walker", "summary": "Mind Walker is an labyrinth/maze arcade game released in 1986 by Commodore for the Amiga Computer.", "themes": [18], "updated_at": 1670973346, "checksum": "2bbd0e73-7af5-fcf7-8d3f-cd68dea311fd", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 22171, "created_at": 1470229349, "name": "Super Ox Wars", "slug": "super-ox-wars", "summary": "Super Ox Wars is a polarity-style scrolling shooter from Llamasoft.", "updated_at": 1670973390, "checksum": "b734cb6c-bb09-1ed0-4abd-a77154a6ea0c", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 22188, "created_at": 1470230272, "first_release_date": 1351382400, "name": "Buddha Finger", "platforms": [34, 39], "release_dates": [122622, 118326], "slug": "buddha-finger", "summary": "Game inspired by Elite Beat Agents and martial arts flicks.", "updated_at": 1670973436, "checksum": "dfc3bde7-dcfd-31c3-9434-a698b51c3008", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 137030, "created_at": 1598269155, "name": "Blockstory", "slug": "blockstory", "updated_at": 1670973483, "checksum": "6d44b438-3564-5c67-b379-cf4dc9ce24c1", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 24108, "created_at": 1474555161, "first_release_date": 1075939200, "name": "The Road to Baghdad", "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [57295], "slug": "the-road-to-baghdad", "summary": "This RTS recreates that battles of Operation Iraqi Freedom.", "updated_at": 1670973506, "checksum": "2b5696fd-6376-5ec4-0656-17b4d26f3385", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 15574, "created_at": 1451586513, "first_release_date": 536371200, "genres": [14], "name": "Ian Botham's Test Match", "platforms": [69], "release_dates": [43014], "slug": "ian-bothams-test-match", "updated_at": 1670973507, "checksum": "d48e9e3c-6b73-0e57-bb97-8bc22924af97", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 25521, "created_at": 1478022027, "name": "Chaos Heroes", "slug": "chaos-heroes", "summary": "Collect and train your heroes, gather your teammates, strengthen your crew and wipe out the enemy in thrilling. \n\nCHAOS HEROES has over hundreds of addictive quests, awarded game mechanics and constantly evolving game world.\n\nAn exceptionally rich and addictive game\n\nChoose between over 100 unique and varied Heroes, from melee bruisers, agile archers and powerful mages\n\nDevelop and upgrade your skills while collecting equipment sets.\nAn immersive experience with friends or go solo on your own in numerous battles\n\nBlend cooperation with your friends as you battle against competing guilds for elite prizes \n\nDevelop team play and strategies to rule the world of Chaos Heroes \nFight through the PVP Arena for awards fame! \n\nFight against a horde of enemies in challenging special events!", "updated_at": 1670973537, "checksum": "75357c57-3fa2-80d6-6244-7edac1ec5317", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 16566, "created_at": 1453194489, "first_release_date": 1393977600, "game_modes": [2, 3], "involved_companies": [30926], "name": "Centration", "platforms": [3, 6], "release_dates": [44576, 44577], "slug": "centration", "summary": "Join your friends and dozens of other players from around the world to crew a space station in a far away solar system, working together to maintain, defend and manage everything from patrol schedules to the state of the fusion engines. Gain experience in your chosen field to earn more responsibility and command your own team or department. Reward good players with accolades to increase their reputation or give troublemakers a hard time with strictures that will keep them out of serious games. Teamwork is key to survival and doing your best and relying on your crewmates is the only way to succeed.", "updated_at": 1670973602, "checksum": "7f0476b8-292f-1bcb-b2fa-af03a401e99b", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 25462, "created_at": 1478015164, "name": "Wildlife Park Tycoon", "slug": "wildlife-park-tycoon", "summary": "A game where you can manage your own zoo.", "updated_at": 1670973615, "checksum": "fb2db499-1301-dbfd-d566-c701142a9837", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 24596, "aggregated_rating": 58.0, "aggregated_r