ing declined over centuries. The former ruler's castle Avars is shrouded in mystery, and Isvar chooses to investigate it. Unfortunately, he finds himself trapped in a mysterious castle from which he must escape. \n \nViewed isometrically, Isvar's adventure features complex object manipulation: each object has its own physical properties and resultant characteristics in terms of how much else can be carried alongside it. The castle is guarded and full of trolls, who can weaken Isvar's energy - food and wine can restore it.\" --mobygames.com", "updated_at": 1670976098, "checksum": "2a67edfa-483f-8643-39dd-0f40d3885372", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 88409, "created_at": 1519306207, "name": "Industry Transporter 3D", "slug": "industry-transporter-3d", "updated_at": 1670976098, "checksum": "00788c54-f2ea-ea37-6212-282d0ef9b0a7", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 54140, "created_at": 1501672655, "first_release_date": 1208390400, "genres": [13], "involved_companies": [112493], "name": "Jet Storm: Modern Dogfights", "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [217330], "slug": "jet-storm-modern-dogfights", "summary": "It\u2019s 2006, and the United States faces a new and terrible enemy. Surviving terrorist groups have formed an alliance with the South American drug cartels. Armed with revolutionary new weapons, the enemy quickly takes control of key strategic regions in the Western hemisphere before launching an invasion of the United States. You\u2019re a pilot in an elite air force unit. Your mission is to stop the enemy, and discover the secrets behind the mysterious new technology that lets enemy forces remain invisible. You\u2019ll take control of an ultra-modern fighter, and dive into a rich variety of combat missions that include intercept, escort, strike, and rescue operations. Many deadly dogfights and chilling encounters with enemy secret weapons await you in the skies over Florida Keys, the Panama Canal Zone, Ecuador, and Cuba! Victories bring numerous rewards: new planes and weapons become available as you progress through the campaign. Once the enemy invasion is defeated, it\u2019s time to go on the offensive - and eliminate the evil mastermind behind the enemy weapons technology, who is preparing a deadly counterattack from a secret hideout deep in the tropical jungle. If you don\u2019t find him in time - all your fighting might have been in vain\u2026 An original storyline, spectacular visuals, and realistic sound effects make Jet Storm: Modern Dogfights a thrilling adventure full of heart-stopping action.", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670976102, "checksum": "33c926d5-f206-b890-a444-97f5957fc993", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 22326, "aggregated_rating": 70.0, "aggregated_rating_count": 1, "created_at": 1470257372, "name": "Cell: Emergence", "slug": "cell-emergence", "total_rating": 70.0, "total_rating_count": 1, "updated_at": 1670976103, "checksum": "5cfd8a49-0c0d-5325-fef9-28da2d4982eb", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 105966, "created_at": 1532194833, "name": "Wizard's Words", "slug": "wizards-words", "updated_at": 1670976103, "checksum": "91a7b25a-64d1-7d8a-d32b-796e3479969a", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 120243, "created_at": 1561830304, "involved_companies": [80684], "name": "Take Cover!", "slug": "take-cover", "updated_at": 1670976105, "checksum": "d16806e8-345c-8870-8778-f6bbcb6c29a0", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 140119, "created_at": 1603111413, "name": "Dark Romance: The Swan Sonata", "slug": "dark-romance-the-swan-sonata", "summary": "Your wedding day goes dark... and your fianc\u00e9e has no idea who's behind it all.", "updated_at": 1670976108, "checksum": "75a5ed45-5636-492f-cdba-f99b2e1178e7", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 41032, "created_at": 1498617557, "first_release_date": 567907200, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [5, 33], "involved_companies": [51361], "name": "Space Lobsters", "platforms": [65], "release_dates": [87889], "slug": "space-lobsters", "themes": [1, 18], "updated_at": 1670976112, "checksum": "ebee27de-6d78-1fe5-ecfc-6cb0380d0e18", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 31345, "created_at": 1495629345, "first_release_date": 1481760000, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [12, 13], "involved_companies": [48407], "name": "VR Journey", "platforms": [6], "rating": 50.0, "rating_count": 0, "release_dates": [74563], "slug": "vr-journey", "summary": "Welcome to the Astral! You are here to defend the portal! Use your determination and reaction skills to repel the demons that want to invade our world! Slow down the time, defeat enemies by meteorite rains and make them eat your arrows!", "themes": [1], "total_rating": 50.0, "total_rating_count": 0, "updated_at": 1670976117, "checksum": "d3407b95-db5a-43b5-8aaa-c6f744a656ee", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 89708, "created_at": 1519989045, "name": "The Secret of Raven Rock", "slug": "the-secret-of-raven-rock", "updated_at": 1670976118, "checksum": "34565f0c-a0b2-adcb-18a4-1356daeccf57", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 90062, "created_at": 1520413719, "name": "iMahjong - Mahjong Pairs (Full)", "slug": "imahjong-mahjong-pairs-full", "updated_at": 1670976118, "checksum": "bd2d86f1-c3f4-c0b9-dba7-a549a3cc2d8c", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 129612, "created_at": 1581304880, "name": "Fighters Kyodotai", "platforms": [82, 6], "release_dates": [188426, 188427], "slug": "fighters-kyodotai", "summary": "Fighters Kyodotai is a great freeware 2D fighting game from Japan. Although the game's graphics looks a bit outdated in VGA, Fighters Kyodotai shines through in the gameplay department. \n \nTo begin with, there are dozens of characters to choose from, many from well-known Japanese manga/anime and video game series, including Doraemon, Dragonball Z, Pandora Crisis, and many more. Many fighters are original designs, and each fighter has plenty of unique and special attacks you can perform. The animations are excellent, and the controls intuitive. The computer players are very challenging - a lot of them will run up to you at lightning speed and perform 10+ hits combo before you can react. This may frustrate fighting game novices, although experts should welcome the chance to play a tough fanmade fighting game for once. The game is in Japanese, but it shouldn't be hard to figure out the controls If you enjoy beat'em ups, Fighters Kyodotai is a very well-made freeware old game that is well worth your time and the hefty download. Be warned of two minor weaknesses, though: the game doesn't let you change difficulty level or save key configurations. There is some nudity in the game, although it is not as nearly blatant as \"Hentai\" fighting games.", "updated_at": 1670976121, "checksum": "bf4a8094-92de-f8b0-4445-b173cb7cc74a", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 13169, "created_at": 1444000124, "first_release_date": 1475798400, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [12], "hypes": 1, "involved_companies": [26881], "name": "Steamfarer", "platforms": [3, 6, 14], "release_dates": [123653], "slug": "steamfarer", "summary": "Steamfarer is an RPG about steampunk airships. You take on a role of a captain of a flying vessel to embark on a hazardous but exciting journey through steampunk world. But to venture far enough you will need a powerful ship and experienced crew. Fortunately, the world is rich with steampunk technology and eager adventurers who would like to join you. Your crew members can develop their skills of manning various gun types and learn powerful abilities. \nThe game is being developed by me, Igor Rashkuev. Development started in November 2014. \n \nFAQ \nQ: When the game is going to be released? \nA: There is no release date yet, but I hope for some time in 2016. \n \nQ: Which platforms the game will be avaliable on? \nA: The game will definitely be on Steam (PC version for sure, I hope Mac and Linux will work out too), and probably on other PC stores. Then I'll see what I can do with mobile and console versions. \n \nQ: Will the game be released in Early Access? \nA: Nope, the game will be released as a final product. \n \nQ: Are you going to run crowdfunding campaign? \nA: At the moment there are no such plans. \n \nQ: How many people are on the team? \nA: Just me. \n \nQ: So you're doing all the programming, art, design etc yourself? \nA: Yup.", "updated_at": 1670976123, "checksum": "70827723-52e6-4647-96f0-2aebce19c351", "game_status": 4, "game_type": 0}, {"id": 37640, "created_at": 1497873948, "genres": [12], "name": "Xanadu II", "slug": "xanadu-ii", "summary": "Falcom has pretty much established themselves as one of the finest RPG makers in the business, and Xanadu II - an offshoot of the Legend of Heroes series shows exactly why. The sequel to the first popular Xanadu game, Xanadu II is also an action RPG. This game retains the simple Ys inspired walk-into-the-enemy attack style which works very well and also the side-on action scenes used for boss battles. Being untranslated, the story is a little hard to plot out, but you play Arios and start out aboard a ship in search of your friend, whose own ship (as shown in the intro) was attacked by dragon riders. Eventually you get blown overboard in a vicious storm and end up on a beach near the city of Razan...", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670976123, "checksum": "16fa8b2c-fa27-3dfb-4179-715dcf811816", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 99406, "created_at": 1524917639, "name": "Tube Jumpers", "slug": "tube-jumpers", "updated_at": 1670976124, "checksum": "23593866-d110-6410-9fea-c60ca879a04e", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 98857, "created_at": 1524659491, "name": "City Bus Driving Sim", "slug": "city-bus-driving-sim", "updated_at": 1670976125, "checksum": "639bdcdd-b795-7fa2-b821-0071416fae33", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 99706, "created_at": 1524987342, "name": "Build Craft 2: Survival & Exploration", "slug": "build-craft-2-survival-and-exploration", "updated_at": 1670976125, "checksum": "d3175453-2a5b-c29e-12a6-8774d057dfee", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 107649, "created_at": 1535961105, "name": "Kids Vehicles Fire Truck games", "slug": "kids-vehicles-fire-truck-games", "updated_at": 1670976125, "checksum": "9f4c32ac-3ab2-ef