ated_at": 1524124708, "name": "Shuffle 'n Slide", "slug": "shuffle-n-slide", "updated_at": 1670976156, "checksum": "9bc7794a-a48e-e1b0-3ae0-effe572d9ea9", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 52623, "created_at": 1501413670, "name": "Athopiu Complete", "slug": "athopiu-complete", "updated_at": 1670976158, "checksum": "06689d93-737e-d7af-5617-c45141e96d62", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 87144, "created_at": 1518620912, "genres": [13], "name": "Hunting Animals - Shooting Simulator", "rating": 40.0, "rating_count": 0, "slug": "hunting-animals-shooting-simulator", "summary": "Winter hunting has never been so realistic! \nProfessional equipment and smart prey\nDangerous enemies and free exploration \nHunting in Ontario, Alaska or Colorado. \nEach location proposes challenging hunting missions.\nit's Hunting Animals - Shooting Simulator!\n\nYou can also meet trophy animals on some of the levels. Find them to decorate your own trophy room.\n\nChoose from the weapons available:\nsniper rifles\nhunting rifles\nprofessional crossbow\nshotgun.\n\nCharacteristics:\ndangerous animals to hunt down\nprofessional equipment\n3 locations to hunt on with numerous missions\nsniper aiming\nhunting with a dog\nfree exploration.", "themes": [1], "total_rating": 40.0, "total_rating_count": 0, "updated_at": 1670976158, "checksum": "1f34182a-0465-7d27-b87b-11b96c123b75", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 49706, "created_at": 1500024834, "first_release_date": 997574400, "genres": [14], "name": "Mahjong Keiji", "platforms": [24], "release_dates": [385926], "slug": "mahjong-keiji", "summary": "Mahjong Keiji is a Miscellaneous game, published by Hudson, which was released in Japan in 2001.", "updated_at": 1670976160, "checksum": "fbdef3b9-36bc-7a17-2ed5-f3243f2aaca0", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 108500, "created_at": 1536212526, "name": "Returner Alien", "slug": "returner-alien", "updated_at": 1670976162, "checksum": "4ecdb993-aae3-53a2-0a4b-2ed8ae69b3da", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 88996, "created_at": 1519423876, "first_release_date": 1464220800, "genres": [13], "name": "Farming PRO 2016", "platforms": [39], "rating": 80.0, "rating_count": 0, "release_dates": [150318], "slug": "farming-pro-2016", "summary": "Jump into addictive and dazzling world of farming with Farming PRO 2016. Enjoy one of the most realistic and largest worlds ever available on phones and tablets. Invite your friends to help you with your farming tasks in a brand new local multiplayer mode.\n\nStart your agricultural career today. Harvest fields, raise animals and supervise your farm. Master over sixty farm tools and vehicles. Expand your farm, discover new map areas, buy new fields and upgrade your infrastructure to maximize your farming profit. Take advantage of the changing economy and sell your products at the highest price. \n\n\nFEATURES\n\u25cf Experience highly realistic and detailed 3D graphics with stunning open world gameplay\n\u25cf Own over sixty precisely designed vehicles and tools, including tractors, combine harvesters, trailers, trucks, cultivators, sowing machines and many more\n\u25cf Hire AI assistants to help you with your work.\n\u25cf Walk or drive around your farm (also enjoy interior view for all vehicles)\n\u25cf Plant, spray, grow and harvest corn, canola, wheat, hay, sugar beets and potatoes to sell them on the market at different prices\n\u25cf Raise cows, sheep, chickens and pigs and feed them with optimal fodder to guarantee highest productivity\n\u25cf Manage your farm with friends thanks to local multiplayer mode", "total_rating": 80.0, "total_rating_count": 0, "updated_at": 1670976164, "checksum": "fd14cdd0-731e-7002-9b80-db8a65ad303a", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 95784, "created_at": 1522148125, "name": "Ride to hill: Offroad Hill Climb", "slug": "ride-to-hill-offroad-hill-climb", "updated_at": 1670976165, "checksum": "8a586bdd-ab98-a1c9-e7ac-516212934830", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 15576, "created_at": 1451586752, "first_release_date": 410140800, "name": "3-D Maze", "platforms": [69], "release_dates": [43017], "slug": "3-d-maze", "updated_at": 1670976167, "checksum": "a1c6822f-76ac-3a64-e7b1-d967988ead7a", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 47952, "created_at": 1499885340, "first_release_date": 1192924800, "genres": [9], "name": "Spelling Challenges", "platforms": [20], "release_dates": [94576], "slug": "spelling-challenges", "summary": "GAME DETAILS \nWords, words, words! \n \nThey're the fundamentals of language. They comprise how we communicate and how effectively we can express opinions and succeed at fulfilling our dreams. One of the earliest brain teasers was the Spelling Bee. Recently, we've been experiencing an upsurge in popularity and fascination with word games. \n \nOn Broadway, people are flocking to the musical 25th Putnam County Spelling Bee. In the movies, the recent Akeelah and the Bee, and Spellbound became surprise hits with millions of fans. The primal challenge to see how many words you can spell correctly to win the game. It's the game that took over as brains rose in significance over brawn. Unlike Akeelah, who had to carry thousands of cards to practice for her Spelling Bee challenges, all you need is the Nintendo DS and Crave's Spelling Challenges and More. It's for Spellin Bee aspirants and for future literati (did I spell that correctly?). \n \nSpelling Challenges and More! is themed around a spelling game show \" where you compete for points and prizes but also is much more! Of course, there's only one winner. Will it be you? Designed for ages 6 and over ESRB is E for Everyone - Fun and educational word challenges for Everyone How many spelling errors can you find in this dscription? \n \nBe challenged from over 25,000 words to spell \nChoose from 100 difficulty levels \nCompete in 11 different games", "updated_at": 1670976167, "checksum": "8ef83ae7-d23e-24e6-dcc8-ef77d9a250dd", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 108502, "created_at": 1536212538, "name": "Throne of Magic", "slug": "throne-of-magic", "updated_at": 1670976168, "checksum": "16dca280-eee5-cafe-66d2-8f9d6e188621", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 89200, "created_at": 1519469146, "first_release_date": 1250726400, "involved_companies": [170929], "name": "Battle Bears: Zombies AR", "platforms": [39, 14], "release_dates": [358643, 358644], "slug": "battle-bears-zombies-ar", "summary": "Play the very first Battle Bears game that started the popular series!\n\nThe game stars Oliver, a teddy bear stuck behind enemy lines who must fight off unending waves of Pink Bears wishing to hug him to death.\n\nGame play is simple and fun. Use one thumb to aim and the other thumb to tap-and-fire.", "updated_at": 1670976169, "checksum": "80f689cc-1870-4c0a-20ef-708c9f40dbe3", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 10431, "created_at": 1432040505, "first_release_date": 1378080000, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [32, 33], "involved_companies": [23796], "name": "Vsevolod", "platforms": [34], "release_dates": [29783], "slug": "vsevolod", "summary": "Welcome to Vsevolod, the awesome game of battle for the control of the Galaxy and the world domination!\n\nYou, Vsevolod the Knight, are destined to unite all tribes, liberate the long-suffering peoples in the farthest corners of space, and bring the peace and prosperity to the Galaxy. But first you have to destroy all your enemies. You can destroy them by taking their life energy by bumping into them, but remember, this takes your life energy, too. You can also bump them into each other or into the walls. You can also bump them into other objects, like stars, asteroids, and various pieces of garbage floating in space. Good luck with your quest and remember - the fate of the Galaxy lies with you!", "themes": [17], "updated_at": 1670976171, "checksum": "3051af6e-b375-b52f-8e4d-e3424dcdef0a", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 86717, "created_at": 1518601412, "first_release_date": 1510012800, "genres": [31], "name": "Robbers Runners", "platforms": [14], "release_dates": [147203], "slug": "robbers-runners", "summary": "What would happen if a thief, robbing a bank, had a machine that cloned people?\nThis thief, he cloned himself, several times, and cloned many bags of money?\nWell, in our history, this is our case, and you have as mission, to kill them, and not to allow them to reach the lair.\nand that's it, very simple ... so let's play !!", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670976172, "checksum": "80030ab1-5f48-e518-7703-806f2ae15b65", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 13267, "created_at": 1444581917, "first_release_date": 441676800, "involved_companies": [196049], "name": "3-D Monster Chase", "platforms": [26, 25], "release_dates": [429989, 429990], "slug": "3-d-monster-chase", "updated_at": 1670976173, "checksum": "cbec4f69-edd4-dd8a-a651-f7cd3ec77970", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 104705, "created_at": 1530518752, "name": "Rotate 2 Learn: Christmas Edition Puzzles!", "slug": "rotate-2-learn-christmas-edition-puzzles", "updated_at": 1670976175, "checksum": "f40a726e-3552-5ca4-4751-386762dc3cc1", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 101104, "created_at": 1525940745, "genres": [12], "involved_companies": [65391], "name": "Intensive Care ( Hospital Interactive Story )", "platforms": [34, 39], "release_dates": [153494], "slug": "intensive-care-hospital-interactive-story", "storyline": "You are a new intern in the hospital, you will be able to gradually discover and socialize with your colleagues but also your patients. Make the right choices and you will have the opportunity to learn more about them. Despite their different secrets and personalities, maybe someone would make you fall in love? \n \nWould you choose the alluring Hadrien? The kind patient Killian? Or would you get back to your ex Jason? Despite the stress, the emergencies, the love and the jealousy, would you be able to manage everything?", "summary": "A new story gamel by Tictales : Hospital Interactive Story! Plunge in the medical world and make life changing choices in every episode! \n \nYou are a new intern in the hospital, you will be able to gradually discover and socialize with your colleagues but also your patients. Make the right choices and you will have the opportunity to learn more about them. Despite their different secrets and personalities, maybe someone would make you fall in love? \n \nWould you choose the alluring Hadrien? The kind patient Killian? Or would you get back to your ex Jason? Despite the stress, the emergencies, the love and the jealousy, would you be able to manage everything? \n \nWho never dreamed about being a doctor and save lives for a living? Who doesn\u2019t want to know how it feels to work in one of the most important professions in the world? \nNow you can! With this new game Hospital Interactive Story you can dive into a fantasy world witch in it you are a doctor! \nRush to the hospital and start an amazing adventure! make life choices that can take you to places you\u2019ve never been! \n \nHospital Interactive Story is a new interactive episode game that gives you the opportunity to create your own story! It doesn't matter if you are a man or woman, boy or girl, gay or straight, every one of you gets the opportunity to make choices by your own personal judgement and create a story just for you - an individual life story. \n \nif your dream is being a doctor and work in a hospital, now you can see how it feels! \nThis is an amazing opportunity to see the interactive life of a doctor, to make choices as one in every episode of this story game, and even find love! \nYou can meet and interact with patients, friends, colleagues and potential partner! \nIn every episode of the game you will get the chance to make choices that make you the person you wish to be. \n \nIn this new game you will have to find balance your choices between two central components of your daily life: love and career. It is known that people have a hard time managing these two areas successfully, and this is one of the reasons that make this game so great - it can actually help you. By playing the game on a daily basis, you can learn more about yourself through the choices you make. \n \nHospital Interactive Story FEATURES: \n- You have full control of the story - your choices will make an impact. \n- Multiple different characters you can interact with in different ways. \n- Create your dream romance and love story. \n- Find the balance balance between business and pleasure. \n- Enchanting realistic graphics, colors and sounds. \n- learn how to be the best doctor", "updated_at": 1670976179, "checksum": "cc58a8de-90b2-9117-e29a-7746a6cdea35", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 39722, "created_at": 1498137806, "name": "Moon Quasar", "slug": "moon-quasar", "updated_at": 1670976180, "checksum": "4f95b5d7-e77b-aae2-b2dd-e9f4720c12b9", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 100510, "created_at": 1525335361, "name": "Zombie Area!", "slug": "zombie-area", "updated_at": 1670976180, "checksum": "a13237b2-dfb7-9a64-8db7-7d1e6f028126", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 93814, "created_at": 1521377095, "name": "Zamboni Challenge", "slug": "zamboni-challenge", "updated_at": 1670976183, "checksum": "78b6de48-5448-d9b8-5ac6-fd0ea4d10d2e", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 90368, "created_at": 1520943030, "name": "Monster Hospital - Kids Game", "slug": "monster-hospital-kids-game", "updated_at": 1670976186, "checksum": "d7bb4e9f-d2cd-f97e-4fb2-b496fadfd211", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 47837, "created_at": 1499883057, "first_release_date": 1188086400, "involved_companies": [173646, 173647], "name": "The Soukou Kihei Gun Ground", "platforms": [20], "release_dates": [94482], "slug": "the-soukou-kihei-gun-ground", "summary": "Pilot a fully customizable mech suit in this side scrolling action game. You can swap parts and add upgrades to make your mech suit unique to you!\n\nThis game features random level generation and a branching story that makes for tons of replay value! You'll never play through the same game twice!\n\nThere is also a multiplayer versus mode in which up to 4 players can connect wirelessly and battle it out using just one cartridge!\n\nThis game is 