lp identify the stories people get wrong most often. \n \nData on public misconceptions in politics is highly reliant on surveys and our hope is with a large audience of people playing, we can make these statistics more robust and reduce response bias.", "themes": [32, 34], "updated_at": 1670977159, "checksum": "0748809f-d36c-ca00-e83c-dd749c577b95", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 98722, "created_at": 1524656205, "name": "Math Race", "slug": "math-race", "updated_at": 1670977165, "checksum": "fed66ffa-2b64-1e15-2eca-e75cd057e62c", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 99171, "created_at": 1524816045, "name": "Escape Quest 8:Peace Keeper", "slug": "escape-quest-8-peace-keeper", "updated_at": 1670977165, "checksum": "fbec9bff-422e-ca9b-858e-ffe6ff228276", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 88796, "created_at": 1519330202, "name": "Next Backgammon", "rating": 30.0, "rating_count": 0, "slug": "next-backgammon", "total_rating": 30.0, "total_rating_count": 0, "updated_at": 1670977166, "checksum": "08d05538-34f6-4dce-c76f-2d0725391843", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 95873, "created_at": 1522151165, "name": "Dimension Summoner: Hero Arena 3D Fantasy RPG", "slug": "dimension-summoner-hero-arena-3d-fantasy-rpg", "updated_at": 1670977168, "checksum": "fb5e0937-a0f2-2993-c8ea-8e712d97f096", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 103491, "created_at": 1529312402, "name": "Dream Bubblez", "slug": "dream-bubblez", "updated_at": 1670977170, "checksum": "d95ea713-4377-ccb3-2c28-375c922dc010", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 42145, "created_at": 1499069022, "first_release_date": 412905600, "genres": [8], "name": "Lobster Bay", "platforms": [129], "release_dates": [90632], "slug": "lobster-bay", "summary": "Lobster Bay is a prototype from Funware which was never released. \n \nIn Lobster Bay you take the role of a scuba diver in search of missing treasure. You start the game by dismounting from your ship to further dive to greater depths. Along your journey you will encounter Lobsters and Squid. Luckily you have ladders, pipes, ropes, and conve