missions you are playing, but one thing is for sure: this challenging game will keep you entertained for a long time!", "updated_at": 1670977753, "checksum": "ddeb57eb-6c4c-b375-bc64-dc068e454a31", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 83729, "created_at": 1516572887, "name": "Haymakers", "slug": "haymakers", "summary": "Haymakers is a 2D platformer. You play as Lottie the scarecrow who, with the help of her trusty Hitchfork, can hitch onto objects and enemies. When she's hitched onto something, she can let go and launch herself at incredible speeds! She can use this ability to zoom through levels, break blocks, and fly through the air! \n \nLottie will also meet a few friends along the way, including another scarecrow she can help by breaking him out of traps.", "updated_at": 1670977754, "checksum": "c787a707-3a7f-d2fe-f164-68429a9275e2", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 95147, "created_at": 1521819914, "name": "SuperTrains", "rating": 20.0, "rating_count": 0, "slug": "supertrains", "total_rating": 20.0, "total_rating_count": 0, "updated_at": 1670977765, "checksum": "c6bc0b6f-4e57-18c2-69bb-5ca5749c4b33", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 12582, "created_at": 1442389346, "first_release_date": 631065600, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [15], "name": "Emperor of the Mines", "platforms": [16], "release_dates": [36070], "slug": "emperor-of-the-mines", "themes": [18], "updated_at": 1670977766, "checksum": "f56889f6-6708-e25d-f64e-cd382eb2324b", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 110116, "created_at": 1537775026, "first_release_date": 1553644800, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [13, 32], "involved_companies": [80901], "name": "Willowbrooke Post", "platforms": [6], "rating": 50.0, "rating_count": 0, "release_dates": [166770], "slug": "willowbrooke-post", "summary": "Take care of your parents' post office following their unexpected departure and return to your childhood home in the quaint, countryside village of Willowbrooke. Manage the establishment for a year, while becoming a part of the local community, brimming with 