ton menu: pause/quit, ship info, lay explosives, return to game, display secury code, and info on anti-Visitor red dust formula. Also, there's six number keys (the aliens count in base 6) which you need to type in security codes to unlock doors. You can also move between levels using teleport pads. Finding the key points in the ship is crucial before you set the explosives which will be on a timer so you have a chance to get out before they blow the ship up.", "updated_at": 1670978636, "checksum": "b867295e-06ac-8491-d0ce-b668357c1632", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 96556, "created_at": 1524123769, "name": "Real Air Hockey", "slug": "real-air-hockey", "updated_at": 1670978636, "checksum": "888ce67f-c40f-06a8-a282-c71359625e18", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 68757, "created_at": 1506516727, "name": "Machinegun Geometry: The Right Angle", "slug": "machinegun-geometry-the-right-angle", "updated_at": 1670978637, "checksum": "59568fbe-463c-f1f4-a786-b5a62c52ad1a", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 24581, "aggregated_rating": 70.0, "aggregated_rating_count": 1, "created_at": 1475434339, "name": "Quick Wordz", "slug": "quick-wordz", "total_rating": 70.0, "total_rating_count": 1, "updated_at": 1670978638, "checksum": "93fa89ba-ddb7-fe6b-d8aa-fac589a860a9", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 104377, "created_at": 1530179534, "name": "Hit Devil Bear - Defence Homeland", "slug": "hit-devil-bear-defence-homeland", "updated_at": 1670978642, "checksum": "c0527abe-5fce-8b13-173c-c5d2c9e90412", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 128831, "created_at": 1579774244, "first_release_date": 1382486400, "involved_companies": [91207, 91206, 91205], "name": "Shapes 'N' Mates", "platforms": [82], "release_dates": [186683], "slug": "shapes-n-mates", "summary": "Assemble crazy shapes in order to open a beautiful treasure chest full of beautiful treasure. Can you pick the correct shapes this wild mess of lies and smiles?", "updated_at": 1670978643, "checksum": "f98f99d4-2bc5-371e-2d58-de56227b066f", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 84056, "created