itRush \nPitrush is a couch coop arena combat game. \n \nYou slip into the role of a powerful gladiator in a dystopian asian cyberpunk world. \nJoin the fight with up to 3 more friends to fight for glory and fame and slash evil robots. \n \nLife in the pits is tough. The audience decides whether you will rise or fall. \nEntertain the masses with skillful moves, and they might reward you.", "themes": [18], "updated_at": 1670978808, "checksum": "e6ccbac4-bd89-06ae-c542-c26701fa6583", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 90527, "created_at": 1520949095, "name": "Snowboarding+", "slug": "snowboarding-plus", "updated_at": 1670978812, "checksum": "e9f81b3d-290f-d2be-d1be-b5dcc671a943", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 102461, "created_at": 1527164291, "name": "Space Cone", "slug": "space-cone", "updated_at": 1670978815, "checksum": "f9bb1ad4-ae35-8471-0060-270394eeaf81", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 102260, "created_at": 1527153740, "hypes": 1, "involved_companies": [65088], "name": "Legendary Eleven: Epic Football", "slug": "legendary-eleven-epic-football", "summary": "Legendary Eleven is an epic arcade football (soccer) game inspired by the golden age of football spanning the 70's to the 90's.", "updated_at": 1670978822, "checksum": "82c8df61-5135-1a77-c014-e5313717f42b", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 46447, "created_at": 1499546728, "first_release_date": 1434153600, "genres": [13], "name": "Airliner Pilot", "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [98002], "slug": "airliner-pilot", "summary": "Have you ever wanted to fly for a major airline? Fancy travelling the world, being responsible for millions of pounds worth of material and for the safety and comfort of hundreds of passengers? Wouldn't it be great if you could do it in FS2004? \n \nNow you can. Airliner Pilot is a unique piece of software that puts you into control of an airliner in your own fictional airline. Starting as a Junior First Officer in the right-hand seat seat of a turboprop aircraft you'll make your way through a pilot's career. \nYour airline will assign you routes to fly according to your rank and aircraft allowances. With growing experience and successful flying you will gain type ratings for larger aircraft on longer routes and eventually be promoted to take the Captain's place in the left-hand seat. \n \nWinner of Aircraft Illustrated's prestigious award for Best Flight Sim Product of 2005. They wrote: \"This creates a whole new challenge for users of Flight Simulator. It is great fun, easy to use and one of those titles that you find yourself going back to time and again, which is a sign of a great product. We were also very impressed with the rapid response from the publisher when needing help and Airliner Pilot even has its own web site where fans are adding their own extras to make the experience even more enjoyable.\"", "updated_at": 1670978833, "checksum": "833ccf40-dfa5-a023-a0a4-5cd52a4ea6db", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 101705, "created_at": 1526637434, "name": "A knots story", "slug": "a-knots-story", "updated_at": 1670978834, "checksum": "68ec8db3-4b94-06a4-59cd-116243176f63", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 104285, "created_at": 1530175668, "name": "Turtle Swing", "slug": "turtle-swing", "updated_at": 1670978836, "checksum": "98d298ea-c67d-6a2d-7a5d-6f3ebcb510a2", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 53089, "created_at": 1501535930, "name": "G2: Geeks Unleashed", "slug": "g2-geeks-unleashed", "updated_at": 1670978838, "checksum": "74e3cdda-908f-c04b-28cc-da59b7012d9b", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 53753, "created_at": 1501613325, "name": "The Jumping Gent", "slug": "the-jumping-gent", "updated_at": 1670978839, "checksum": "23b614e6-2be5-a998-c31d-b023995c0d1b", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 100516, "created_at": 1525336570, "name": "Sweet Baby Girl Cleanup 4", "slug": "sweet-baby-girl-cleanup-4", "updated_at": 1670978844, "checksum": "c2999bc5-15f1-92b3-0a27-a9ed64ae01fd", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 38602, "created_at": 1497976960, "first_release_date": 691545600, "name": "Sel Feena", "platforms": [52], "release_dates": [86747], "slug": "sel-feena", "summary": "At a time when people were being terrorized by monsters, Selfeena, a little witch, wizard, and magic creature and her little dragon Rich Rich embarked on an adventure to reclaim the treasure stolen from the people by the monsters. Their weapon was the power to put the monsters in boxes. How much treasure can Selfeena recover?", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670978847, "checksum": "21f77663-bc40-ea66-f2a5-709adc7c028c", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 49535, "created_at": 1500023072, "first_release_date": 1036022400, "name": "Beast Shooter: Mezase Beast King", "platforms": [24], "release_dates": [382495], "slug": "beast-shooter-mezase-beast-king", "summary": "Beast Shooter: Mezase Beast King is an Action game, developed by Hudson and published by Konami, which was released in Japan in 2002.", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670978850, "checksum": "1ff00b5c-9d01-6013-4ce6-b7b3efca3d9d", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 95266, "created_at": 1521822306, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [13, 15, 31, 32], "name": "Fairyland: Chronicle", "slug": "fairyland-chronicle", "summary": "Your task is to lead this orc tribe and lead it to prosperity. \nThe game is an interactive fiction stylized as an orc tribe chronicle, which is written by the new Great Tribe Mother.", "updated_at": 1670978852, "checksum": "9c7e267d-766f-f4f4-f54a-274852016870", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 41634, "created_at": 1498828229, "first_release_date": 570672000, "genres": [14], "name": "Family Boxing: MSX Title Match", "platforms": [27], "release_dates": [92160], "slug": "family-boxing-msx-title-match", "summary": "Ring King is a boxing game in which the action in the ring is viewed in a 3D top-down view and a full range of moves is provided, with the standard jabs complimented by body punches and the ability to dodge, duck or raise your guard. \n \nEach punch weakens your opponent's strength which can slightly recover during a round break. A rain of well placed blows can produce a quick knockout, but normally you must hit your opponent many times before he goes down. \n \nThe game has three play modes. There is training mode to train your player before you enter a tournament. A ranking mode where you can select one of the three championships, Rookie, Japan and World. Each championship can be played at five difficulty levels. The third mode is the tournament mode. To reach the number one spot in the ranking or tournament mode you must train your boxer well. \n \nBefore you start you must create your character and set his initial abilities, strength, speed and stamina. Each won bout increases these abilities slightly. The abilities of your opponent and you are visible in the status bar at the top of the screen during the game. Strength is represented with a boxing glove, speed with a shoe and stamina with a dumb bell. \n \nThis game can be played by one player against the computer or by two players against each other. A password is given after each won bout and it enables you to continue with the next match in a tournament at a later time.", "updated_at": 1670978854, "checksum": "897e7c3f-a241-6dec-929c-d869186c62d1", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 96997, "created_at": 1524136206, "name": "The Cube - What's Inside ?", "slug": "the-cube-whats-inside", "updated_at": 1670978855, "checksum": "c1f038eb-06c9-3d7e-5e8d-b6d0e94ea165", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 100985, "created_at": 1525694646, "name": "Toddler Racing Car Game for Kids.", "slug": "toddler-racing-car-game-for-kids", "updated_at": 1670978855, "checksum": "0e22307a-a686-c584-619d-3ec711a2e30e", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 127339, "created_at": 1576197116, "genres": [31], "name": "Orion shadow of jerboa", "slug": "orion-shadow-of-jerboa", "updated_at": 1670978856, "checksum": "28b396c1-5c2f-7a83-b4a0-a43bb225161d", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 50222, "created_at": 1500037963, "genres": [9], "name": "Evy: Magic Spheres", "slug": "evy-magic-spheres", "summary": "Orphan Evy wakes to find herself in a fairytale kingdo