e_dates": [51262, 51261], "slug": "dot-by-dot-plus", "summary": "Nonogram puzzle game.\n\nThe app has been withdrawn from both the Mac App Store and iTunes App Store and can no longer be purchased.", "updated_at": 1670979348, "checksum": "27e2b4b8-fcd1-9ad9-0498-c62feef22792", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 99260, "created_at": 1524915024, "name": "Reiner Knizia's High Society", "slug": "reiner-knizias-high-society", "updated_at": 1670979348, "checksum": "c0317ed9-e1e5-b16c-96e4-1b13332b4852", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 52782, "created_at": 1501492691, "name": "Zatikon: Crusades", "slug": "zatikon-crusades", "updated_at": 1670979351, "checksum": "c34e70d4-785a-5ef6-7706-1a7c05394f30", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 106740, "created_at": 1533113214, "name": "Helix Jump Ball", "slug": "helix-jump-ball", "updated_at": 1670979351, "checksum": "85e42de1-0db4-256c-3c46-8f723cb6798d", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 86825, "created_at": 1518604790, "first_release_date": 1451952000, "genres": [10, 14], "name": "Bus & Taxi Driving Simulator", "platforms": [39], "rating": 90.0, "rating_count": 0, "release_dates": [147583], "slug": "bus-and-taxi-driving-simulator", "summary": "Get your driving gloves on and begin your new career as a Bus & Taxi driver! Pick up passengers and take them to their destinations on time, and Park your vehicle neatly on increasingly complex routes.\n\nFEATURES:\n\u25b6 5 ICONIC WORLD TAXIS \u2013 from New York, London and more!\n\u25b6 7 BIG BUSES \u2013 cars seem to easy? Challenge yourself with steering a big bus!\n\u25b6 PASSENGERS TO PICK UP \u2013 drive them to their destinations quickly and efficiently!\n\u25b6 REALISTIC HILLTOP CITY \u2013 explore it at your leisure or get to the destination as quickly as possible\n\nStart your career in Iconic Taxis from around the globe and move on up to the collection of world-famous BIG and LONG Busses! Regardless of what you drive, your task will be similar \u2013 picking up the passengers and getting them to their destinations quickly and safely.\n\nYou will start out driving iconic, easily recognizable taxis. Feel like a cab driver in London in a famous Black Cab, switch to a Classic Yellow American Chequer Cab, check out some of the European favourites and more! Realistic and fun handling will make every trip an experience for you and your passengers!\n\nWhen you\u2019ve gained enough experience driving taxis, take up the challenge of steering a big bus around some of the cities tightest corners! Stick to your route and to your timetable, be careful not to crash with your passengers! Pass every mission with the New York Bus, Tour Coaches, London Bus, Classic Yellow School Bus and huge Bendy Bus!\n\nThe Main Game Mode including ALL vehicles is 100% FREE to Play, all the way through, no strings attached. In-Game Coins may be purchased with real money to speed up access to some vehicles and extra Game Modes that alter the rules slightly to make the game easier are available through In-App Purchases.", "total_rating": 90.0, "total_rating_count": 0, "updated_at": 1670979353, "checksum": "0522fc6d-ee9f-7d3e-8e00-5864056b9ced", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 95881, "created_at": 1522151239, "name": "PRO Soccer Challenges 2018 - World Football Stars", "slug": "pro-soccer-challenges-2018-world-football-stars", "updated_at": 1670979354, "checksum": "c2054053-b329-978e-fe78-afb5132fc2aa", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 86964, "created_at": 1518615207, "first_release_date": 1475107200, "genres": [33], "involved_companies": [174285], "name": "Hop", "platforms": [34, 39], "rating": 90.0, "rating_count": 0, "release_dates": [363724, 147427], "slug": "hop", "summary": "Bounce off tiles and make as many hops as you can in this mind-blowing arcade action!\n\nTouch the screen and drag left or right to guide the ball from tile to tile. Don\u2019t miss the path! Make insane combos and beat your friend's scores!\n\nWhat is your best score?", "themes": [1], "total_rating": 90.0, "total_rating_count": 0, "updated_at": 167097