tadium or merchandising. The strength of an athlete is calculated from the factors position (how well he can play on the position he has to play), shape (if and how well he played in the past) and energy (physical shape). After each season the manager has to have a certain amount of money on the club's account (how much depends on the chosen difficulty level) in order to avoid being fired. The game also rates the manager's performance which is mostly interesting when multiple players are participating. Controls are completely menu based.", "updated_at": 1670979983, "checksum": "1229bc86-598f-52d0-1fed-6b16be229343", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 100374, "created_at": 1525188093, "name": "Civil War: Bloody April", "slug": "civil-war-bloody-april", "updated_at": 1670979984, "checksum": "b68fcd05-fbfe-ed65-ad64-2eb1e10c84c8", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 126175, "created_at": 1574451508, "first_release_date": 1335830400, "name": "Douse", "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [180303], "slug": "douse", "summary": "Use your ability to control the rain to bring life back to the forest in this poetic platformer. Playfully and curiously explore your environment, all while looking for a way back home to the clouds.", "updated_at": 1670979984, "checksum": "f2772523-7de4-dd75-963b-29343e53e347", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 54325, "created_at": 1501691563, "name": "Rival Ball 2", "slug": "rival-ball-2", "updated_at": 1670979986, "checksum": "47b7ddc5-71f2-6f33-1fbe-c4ff6cb47685", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 54159, "created_at": 1501673309, "name": "Jungle Wild", "slug": "jungle-wild", "updated_at": 1670979987, "checksum": "ea6e6893-5656-4bc1-f898-967810ac2e5e", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 94041, "created_at": 1521388902, "name": "War Z", "slug": "war-z", "updated_at": 1670979988, "checksum": "e92214be-572e-d8fc-015d-83787347a02b", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 13009, "created_at": 1443200056, "name": "Jungle Warfare", "platforms": [25], "release_dates": [37414], "slug": "jungle-warfare", "updated_at": 1670979