rinths of World: Dangerous", "slug": "labyrinths-of-world-dangerous", "updated_at": 1670981157, "checksum": "d8dfbab9-9c2b-97f6-4aac-e751fd368b3e", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 43538, "created_at": 1499155206, "first_release_date": 1099267200, "genres": [13], "name": "Pacif Warriors 2", "platforms": [8], "release_dates": [89350], "slug": "pacif-warriors-2", "summary": "Pacific Warriors II: Dogfight! puts you in the seat of a classic fighter plane during the action-filled Pacific conflict between the Americans and the Japanese during World War II. The focus is on action, not true-to-life flight simulation, but an adrenaline rush as you roar through the skies to take out your next target. Choose your side \u2013 American or Japanese, and follow a historically based time flow through 25 missions in each campaign. Pacific Warriors II: Dogfight! for PlayStation 2 is based on the PC version developed by InterActive Vision Games in 2003/2004.", "updated_at": 1670981161, "checksum": "54a16a97-f5f3-ef6f-c724-1899a7fe11fd", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 121412, "created_at": 1564955671, "first_release_date": 1572566400, "game_modes": [2, 5], "genres": [12, 31, 32], "name": "Deorum Online", "platforms": [6], "release_dates": [178352], "slug": "deorum-online", "summary": "-Open World Full Loot PvP -Unlimited skill based progression -Endless Exploration and Adventure -Player Housing -Dynamic Player Driven Economy -Competitive Top Down Combat", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670981161, "checksum": "d4e92303-f2e1-47ee-7368-a7efe81b040c", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 16304, "created_at": 1452947292, "first_release_date": 1009756800, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [13, 31], "name": "AlterEgo: Browser-Based Life Simulation Game", "platforms": [82, 34, 39], "release_dates": [44179, 44180, 44181], "slug": "alterego-browser-based-life-simulation-game", "summary": "What if you could live your life over again? In Alter Ego, you can find out. In this text-based interactive fiction, you choose what happens next. It's in the style of choose-a-path books, but with over a thousand multiple-choice questions, it's much longer and deeper than traditional gamebooks. Alter Ego starts at birth and ends at death, including two substantially different versions, depending on whether you choose to be male or female.\n\nWill you grow up to be confident and happy? Will you fight with bullies, or befriend them? Will you find a date to the senior prom? Will you marry and have kids, or start your own business and become a millionaire? The choice is yours. If you enjoy interactive novels, you'll love Alter Ego. This game will change your life. (official Text) \n\nDeveloper's Comment: \"Alter Ego was originally written by Peter J. Favaro, Ph.D. It was published in 1986 for the Commodore 64, MS-DOS, Apple II, and Macintosh. The current edition of the Alter Ego game is a production of Choose Multiple LLC.\" (https://www.playalterego.com/credits.html)", "updated_at": 1670981164, "checksum": "74e9b021-5df9-d1a8-ffb6-7ff78f569f24", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 102596, "created_at": 1527328656, "name": "Ant Destroyer 2", "slug": "ant-destroyer-2", "updated_at": 1670981165, "checksum": "29f504e4-5f0d-0552-553e-6606ddfa49fd", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 87204, "created_at": 1518699052, "first_release_date": 1396224000, "genres": [13, 14], "name": "Lacrosse Arcade 2014", "platforms": [39], "rating": 60.0, "rating_count": 0, "release_dates": [148359], "slug": "lacrosse-arcade-2014", "summary": "Dodge, pass, shoot, and defend like never before on your mobile device. Lacrosse Arcade 2014 is a simulation lacrosse video game featuring five lacrosse game modes, and intense lacrosse action! Download Lacrosse Arcade 2014 today!\n\n1) 1v0 - Shooting on a goalie\n2) Offense Transition - Work through 2v1, 3v2, 4v3, 5v4 situations\n3) Fours - 4v4 mini game\n4) Horde - Weave through over 10 players!\n5) Practice - Want to work on fast breaks? No goalie? Play defense?", "total_rating": 60.0, "total_rating_count": 0, "upd