cial commodities, sailing to shipwrecks for amazing rewards and much more!\n\nWater you doing? Do not waste your time and prepare your fleet!\nDo you have what it takes to develop the biggest sea transport business, manage the most powerful ship fleet and become a wealthy tycoon? Try it now! Get ready for an exciting journey through the history of ships! Expand your ship collection from very basic boats to the high tech titans or warships. Build your own port and enter the world of sea & cargo trade!\n\nWater you doing? Do not waste your time and prepare your fleet!", "total_rating": 90.0, "total_rating_count": 0, "updated_at": 1670981909, "checksum": "f9bfaf24-9980-1662-d6aa-670a422894d5", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 13574, "created_at": 1445017473, "genres": [5], "name": "Dead on Time", "platforms": [25], "release_dates": [38988], "slug": "dead-on-time", "updated_at": 1670981911, "checksum": "48681650-4d7d-eaee-1608-da63d14cb809", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 45763, "created_at": 1499514921, "first_release_date": 728524800, "genres": [5, 31], "name": "Jim Power: The Arcade Game", "platforms": [29], "release_dates": [98579], "slug": "jim-power-the-arcade-game", "summary": "Jim Power: The Arcade Game is a Shoot-'Em-Up game, developed and published by Loriciels, which was cancelled before it was released.", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670981912, "checksum": "6b581c29-db3b-c9e1-e713-57452bea531f", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 109934, "created_at": 1537531694, "name": "Cosmobot", "slug": "cosmobot", "updated_at": 1670981914, "checksum": "af002a98-28dc-ea8a-1fca-7499a60c4e27", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 102738, "created_at": 1527487260, "name": "LDS Articles of Faith", "slug": "lds-articles-of-faith", "updated_at": 1670981916, "checksum": "34204e03-7648-507e-29ee-620c26ae8cea", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 96824, "created_at": 1524131238, "name": "Plumber Pipe Connect", "slug": "plumber-pipe-connect", "updated_at": 1670981918, "checksum": "71477edd-fde0-5678-8709-a89e3a874f3c", "game_type"