r people who love Skydriving and also for whom never experiencing the beautiful of risk while being airborne!\n\nEspecially when you learn how to get used with the game, you will discover that everything around you isn't matter anymore, it's just you and the endless Sky Dancing's challenges!\n\nBEAUTIFUL WORLD\n\nInspired by the minimalist 3D art style, simply stunning, every inch of Sky Dancer is visually impressive and delightfully charming.\n\nEASY TO PLAY\n\nTap by 2 fingers to jump, tap the left side of the screen to turn left or tap the right side of the screen to turn right. \n\nSOUND\n\nAudios and music are made with love! Our goal is to provide a surreal and beautiful soundscape. Not just with the headphones, we make sure that Sky Dancer sounds perfect with iPhone/iPad speakers too!\n\nCHARACTERS\n\nDiscover other unique Dancers, more will be added in updates!\n\nCHALLENGES\n\nTest your skills with tons of handcrafted quest and multiplier your score.\n\nGAME CENTER\n\nChallenge your friends with Game Center. Complete for the best score!\n\nICLOUD\n\nSky Dancer is a Universal App with iCloud support. You can play on your iPhone and iPad and your progress will always be in sync.", "themes": [1], "total_rating": 70.0, "total_rating_count": 1, "updated_at": 1670982067, "checksum": "bee60f05-fae0-3f7d-a5fa-6d0b2799f177", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 90036, "created_at": 1520332674, "name": "Memorize Pi Digits", "slug": "memorize-pi-digits", "updated_at": 1670982070, "checksum": "30141ac7-9ca2-a7ee-0b01-010328378ee2", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 101367, "created_at": 1526371028, "game_modes": [1], "genres": [31, 32], "name": "Black Bart", "slug": "black-bart", "summary": "Play for the most successful burglar of stagecoaster in the history of the Wild West. The hero of the quest, who above all appreciates human life, makes afraid without a single shot.", "updated_at": 1670982070, "checksum": "690fc2f3-d512-6b06-6cef-2080d65d491f", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 88112, "created_at