ters, foliage, hazards, and even balloons and bumpers. You can fight with futuristic weapons, medieval weapons, and /or hand to hand combat. There are also many vehicles (and a mutator to spawn them in maps that do not have them, as is tradition (as you can see)). \n \nYou can also set each team to start with different specific weapons if you want to test a theory that you could defeat a well equipped military force with your bolt action rifle or crossbow. Same with vehicles and mounted weapons spawning (you can set which spawn near which team in CTF etc). You can drink wine, potions, learn magic, read scrolls, so on and so forth. \n \nThe goal, and much of this has been reached, is to not limit the player.", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670982178, "checksum": "456512ff-efdc-31b5-7bfd-11b1d2fff56c", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 88458, "created_at": 1519308500, "name": "Dream Day: True Love", "rating": 60.0, "rating_count": 0, "slug": "dream-day-true-love", "total_rating": 60.0, "total_rating_count": 0, "updated_at": 1670982180, "checksum": "7ad8dc3e-5503-6515-1e40-c4d2ffe6c380", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 93819, "created_at": 1521377140, "name": "Kids Alphabet Games", "slug": "kids-alphabet-games", "updated_at": 1670982180, "checksum": "8ec07b85-857a-9546-dfd3-450ec943ea49", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 100257, "created_at": 1525015915, "name": "Cogs Lite", "slug": "cogs-lite", "updated_at": 1670982180, "checksum": "b09fda7c-ade3-a009-4e79-42b58e981832", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 51556, "created_at": 1500631609, "first_release_date": 1500595200, "game_modes": [1, 2, 3, 5], "genres": [8, 31, 32, 33], "name": "FeeSoeeD", "platforms": [6, 14], "release_dates": [100224, 100223], "slug": "feesoeed", "summary": "Welcome to FeeSoeeD. Open the front door to a beautiful underground world of future!", "themes": [1], "updated_at": 1670982181, "checksum": "b2ebd9e7-209e-d586-dcc6-306ebcde971d", "game_type": 0}, {"id": 89171, "created_at": 1519468573, "name": "IQ Wars", "slug": "iq-wars", "up